window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a479-e132c6ddd063df00.json"]={sha256:"e132c6ddd063df00a8d1ff146f474435ad3e06e7f53a3dc4ed29d8beb6ded257",value:{"id":"a479","title":"科學級 CCD 成像系統","titleEn":"Scientific CCD imaging systems","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以天文與光譜用的背照式深冷 CCD 為對象，從矽吸收深度與三相時脈的電荷搬運出發，說明為何一個角落像素要經過 8192 次轉移仍不能掉電荷，再把浮動擴散輸出放大器、減薄與深空乏、暗電流溫度律、光子轉移與 Fe-55 增益、像素合併與宇宙射線、多輸出串擾整合成可驗收的相機紀錄。","summaryEn":"Using back-illuminated, deep-cooled CCDs for astronomy and spectroscopy, start from silicon absorption depth and three-phase charge transport to show why a corner pixel must survive 8192 transfers without losing charge, then integrate the floating-diffusion output amplifier, thinning and deep depletion, the dark-current temperature law, photon-transfer and Fe-55 gain, binning and cosmic rays, and multi-output crosstalk into an acceptable camera record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-astronomical","subcategoryTitle":"天文儀器與科學感測器","subcategoryTitleEn":"Astronomical instrumentation and scientific sensors","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-astronomical","learningTags":["optics","optics-astronomical","detector"],"architectureFamily":"detector","architectureNodes":[["背照式 CCD 感測器","Back-illuminated CCD sensor"],["時脈與偏壓驅動","Clock and bias drivers"],["輸出放大器與 CDS 數位化","Output amplifier and CDS digitiser"],["低溫恆溫器與溫控","Cryostat and temperature control"],["快門與校正光源","Shutter and calibration sources"],["影像校正管線","Image calibration pipeline"]],"architectureEdges":[[1,0],[0,2],[3,0],[4,0],[2,5],[1,2]],"diagram":{"type":"detector","labels":["背照式 CCD 感測器","時脈與偏壓驅動","輸出放大器與 CDS 數位化","低溫恆溫器與溫控","快門與校正光源"],"labelsEn":["Back-illuminated CCD sensor","Clock and bias drivers","Output amplifier and CDS digitiser","Cryostat and temperature control","Shutter and calibration sources"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"暗弱源曝光規劃練習：窄頻濾鏡下目標每像素 0.02 e⁻/s、天光 0.05 e⁻/s，曝光 900 s，得 S = 18 e⁻、天光 45 e⁻。情境 A：−80 °C（暗電流 0.00013 e⁻/px/s，累積 0.12 e⁻）、50 kHz 讀出雜訊 2.9 e⁻，SNR = 18/√(18 + 45 + 0.12 + 8.41) = 18/8.46 = 2.13。情境 B：改用 1 MHz 讀出（7.0 e⁻），SNR = 18/√(112.1) = 1.70。情境 C：只冷到 −40 °C（約 0.0118 e⁻/px/s，累積 10.6 e⁻）、2.9 e⁻，SNR = 18/9.06 = 1.99。若在 A 條件下做晶片上 2×2 合併，SNR = 72/√(72 + 180 + 0.47 + 8.41) = 4.46，比軟體合併的 4.26 只多 5%，因為此時天光已主導雜訊。代價是 2048² 影像以 50 kHz 讀出需 84 s，1 MHz 只需 4.2 s。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實機規格。","textEn":"Faint-source exposure-planning exercise: through a narrowband filter the target gives 0.02 e⁻/s per pixel and the sky 0.05 e⁻/s; a 900 s exposure yields S = 18 e⁻ and 45 e⁻ of sky. Case A: −80 °C (dark 0.00013 e⁻/px/s, 0.12 e⁻ accumulated) with 2.9 e⁻ read noise at 50 kHz gives SNR = 18/√(18 + 45 + 0.12 + 8.41) = 18/8.46 = 2.13. Case B: 1 MHz readout with 7.0 e⁻ gives SNR = 18/√(112.1) = 1.70. Case C: cooling only to −40 °C (about 0.0118 e⁻/px/s, 10.6 e⁻) with 2.9 e⁻ gives SNR = 18/9.06 = 1.99. Binning 2×2 on chip under case A gives SNR = 72/√(72 + 180 + 0.47 + 8.41) = 4.46, only 5% above the 4.26 of software binning because sky noise now dominates. The cost is readout time: a 2048² frame needs 84 s at 50 kHz but only 4.2 s at 1 MHz. Values are teaching assumptions, not any instrument's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a479-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「光電轉換、吸收深度與量子效率」與「電荷耦合搬運與轉移效率」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Photoelectric conversion, absorption depth and quantum efficiency\" and \"Charge-coupled transport and charge-transfer efficiency\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a479-v12-01","title":"光電轉換、吸收深度與量子效率：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Photoelectric conversion, absorption depth and quantum efficiency: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「背照式矽吸收層」如何決定科學級 CCD 成像系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Back-illuminated silicon absorber” determines the key performance of “Scientific CCD imaging systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"矽的能隙 1.12 eV，可見光光子在矽中產生一個電子電洞對，X 光則平均每 3.65 eV 產生一對，因此 CCD 同時是光子計數器與能量計。前照式 CCD 的光要先穿過多晶矽電極，藍光與紫外在電極中被吸收，量子效率只有四成左右；背照式 CCD 把晶片減薄後從背面受光，加上抗反射膜可在可見光超過九成。但矽對紅光與近紅外的吸收長度很長，900 nm 約 33 µm、1000 nm 約 156 µm，薄元件的紅端效率下降，且前後表面反射形成干涉條紋。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「背照式矽吸收層」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Silicon has a 1.12 eV bandgap, so a visible photon creates one electron–hole pair while X-rays create one pair per 3.65 eV on average, making a CCD both a photon counter and an energy meter. In a front-illuminated CCD light must first cross polysilicon gates that absorb blue and ultraviolet, limiting QE to about 40%; a back-illuminated CCD is thinned and illuminated from the back, and with an antireflection coating exceeds 90% in the visible. However, silicon's absorption length is long in the red and near infrared, about 33 µm at 900 nm and 156 µm at 1000 nm, so thin devices lose red response and reflections from both surfaces create interference fringes. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Back-illuminated silicon absorber”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：吸收比例 1 − exp(−d/L)：900 nm（L = 33 µm）時厚 15 µm 吸收 37%、40 µm 為 71%、100 µm 為 95%；1000 nm（L = 156 µm）時 15 µm 只有 9%、100 µm 為 47%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Absorbed fraction 1 − exp(−d/L): at 900 nm (L = 33 µm) a 15 µm layer absorbs 37%, 40 µm absorbs 71% and 100 µm absorbs 95%; at 1000 nm (L = 156 µm) 15 µm absorbs only 9% and 100 µm 47%.","failure":"常見誤解：「背照式 CCD 在所有波長都有九成以上的量子效率。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A back-illuminated CCD has over 90% QE at every wavelength.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「背照式矽吸收層」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Back-illuminated silicon absorber”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-01-k1","title":"光電轉換、吸收深度與量子效率","titleEn":"Photoelectric conversion, absorption depth and quantum efficiency","text":"矽的能隙 1.12 eV，可見光光子在矽中產生一個電子電洞對，X 光則平均每 3.65 eV 產生一對，因此 CCD 同時是光子計數器與能量計。前照式 CCD 的光要先穿過多晶矽電極，藍光與紫外在電極中被吸收，量子效率只有四成左右；背照式 CCD 把晶片減薄後從背面受光，加上抗反射膜可在可見光超過九成。","textEn":"Silicon has a 1.12 eV bandgap, so a visible photon creates one electron–hole pair while X-rays create one pair per 3.65 eV on average, making a CCD both a photon counter and an energy meter. In a front-illuminated CCD light must first cross polysilicon gates that absorb blue and ultraviolet, limiting QE to about 40%; a back-illuminated CCD is thinned and illuminated from the back, and with an antireflection coating exceeds 90% in the visible.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：背照式 CCD 在所有波長都有九成以上的量子效率。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A back-illuminated CCD has over 90% QE at every wavelength. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「光電轉換、吸收深度與量子效率」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Photoelectric conversion, absorption depth and quantum efficiency\" is correct?","options":["背照式 CCD 在所有波長都有九成以上的量子效率。","矽的能隙 1.12 eV，可見光光子在矽中產生一個電子電洞對，X 光則平均每 3.65 eV 產生一對，因此 CCD 同時是光子計數器與能量計。","CTE 為 0.99999 已經接近完美，大面積 CCD 不必再擔心。"],"optionsEn":["A back-illuminated CCD has over 90% QE at every wavelength.","Silicon has a 1.12 eV bandgap, so a visible photon creates one electron–hole pair while X-rays create one pair per 3.65 eV on average, making a CCD both a photon counter and an energy meter.","A CTE of 0.99999 is essentially perfect even for large CCDs."],"answer":1,"explanation":"矽的能隙 1.12 eV，可見光光子在矽中產生一個電子電洞對，X 光則平均每 3.65 eV 產生一對，因此 CCD 同時是光子計數器與能量計。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Silicon has a 1.12 eV bandgap, so a visible photon creates one electron–hole pair while X-rays create one pair per 3.65 eV on average, making a CCD both a photon counter and an energy meter. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a479-v12-02","title":"光電轉換、吸收深度與量子效率：定量估算","titleEn":"Photoelectric conversion, absorption depth and quantum efficiency: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「背照式矽吸收層」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Back-illuminated silicon absorber” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：吸收比例 1 − exp(−d/L)：900 nm（L = 33 µm）時厚 15 µm 吸收 37%、40 µm 為 71%、100 µm 為 95%；1000 nm（L = 156 µm）時 15 µm 只有 9%、100 µm 為 47%。15 µm 厚、n = 3.6 的矽在 900 nm 的條紋間距 λ²/(2nd) = 0.81 µm²/(2×3.6×15 µm) = 7.5 nm，夜天光的窄發射線會產生明顯條紋。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Absorbed fraction 1 − exp(−d/L): at 900 nm (L = 33 µm) a 15 µm layer absorbs 37%, 40 µm absorbs 71% and 100 µm absorbs 95%; at 1000 nm (L = 156 µm) 15 µm absorbs only 9% and 100 µm 47%. A 15 µm layer with n = 3.6 has a fringe spacing at 900 nm of λ²/(2nd) = 0.81 µm²/(2×3.6×15 µm) = 7.5 nm, so narrow night-sky emission lines produce strong fringes. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以單色儀與可溯源校正光電二極體做比值法，每 10 nm 量一次 QE 並與吸收模型及抗反射膜設計曲線比較；以 1 nm 步進的窄頻平場或可調雷射照射，量測條紋振幅與間距，反推矽層厚度分布；紫外端在不同曝光歷史下重複量測以檢查 QE 遲滯。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure QE every 10 nm by the ratio method with a monochromator and a traceable calibrated photodiode, comparing with the absorption model and the antireflection design curve; illuminate with narrowband flats stepped by 1 nm or a tunable laser to measure fringe amplitude and spacing and infer the silicon thickness map; repeat ultraviolet measurements after different illumination histories to check for QE hysteresis.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"吸收比例 1 − exp(−d/L)：900 nm（L = 33 µm）時厚 15 µm 吸收 37%、40 µm 為 71%、100 µm 為 95%；1000 nm（L = 156 µm）時 15 µm 只有 9%、100 µm 為 47%。15 µm 厚、n = 3.6 的矽在 900 nm 的條紋間距 λ²/(2nd) = 0.81 µm²/(2×3.6×15 µm) = 7.5 nm，夜天光的窄發射線會產生明顯條紋。","textEn":"Absorbed fraction 1 − exp(−d/L): at 900 nm (L = 33 µm) a 15 µm layer absorbs 37%, 40 µm absorbs 71% and 100 µm absorbs 95%; at 1000 nm (L = 156 µm) 15 µm absorbs only 9% and 100 µm 47%. A 15 µm layer with n = 3.6 has a fringe spacing at 900 nm of λ²/(2nd) = 0.81 µm²/(2×3.6×15 µm) = 7.5 nm, so narrow night-sky emission lines produce strong fringes.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「光電轉換、吸收深度與量子效率」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Photoelectric conversion, absorption depth and quantum efficiency\", which statement holds?","options":["矽越厚越好，因為紅光量子效率一定越高。","增益就是 ADC 位元數除以滿井，不需量測。","吸收比例 1 − exp(−d/L)：900 nm（L = 33 µm）時厚 15 µm 吸收 37%、40 µm 為 71%、100 µm 為 95%。"],"optionsEn":["Thicker silicon is always better because red QE rises.","Gain is simply full well divided by ADC range and needs no measurement.","Absorbed fraction 1 − exp(−d/L): at 900 nm (L = 33 µm) a 15 µm layer absorbs 37%, 40 µm absorbs 71% and 100 µm absorbs 95%."],"answer":2,"explanation":"吸收比例 1 − exp(−d/L)：900 nm（L = 33 µm）時厚 15 µm 吸收 37%、40 µm 為 71%、100 µm 為 95%；1000 nm（L = 156 µm）時 15 µm 只有 9%、100 µm 為 47%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Absorbed fraction 1 − exp(−d/L): at 900 nm (L = 33 µm) a 15 µm layer absorbs 37%, 40 µm absorbs 71% and 100 µm absorbs 95%; at 1000 nm (L = 156 µm) 15 µm absorbs only 9% and 100 µm 47%. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a479-v12-03","title":"光電轉換、吸收深度與量子效率：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Photoelectric conversion, absorption depth and quantum efficiency: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「背照式矽吸收層」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Back-illuminated silicon absorber” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以單色儀與可溯源校正光電二極體做比值法，每 10 nm 量一次 QE 並與吸收模型及抗反射膜設計曲線比較；以 1 nm 步進的窄頻平場或可調雷射照射，量測條紋振幅與間距，反推矽層厚度分布；紫外端在不同曝光歷史下重複量測以檢查 QE 遲滯。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure QE every 10 nm by the ratio method with a monochromator and a traceable calibrated photodiode, comparing with the absorption model and the antireflection design curve; illuminate with narrowband flats stepped by 1 nm or a tunable laser to measure fringe amplitude and spacing and infer the silicon thickness map; repeat ultraviolet measurements after different illumination histories to check for QE hysteresis. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把薄背照式 CCD 用在近紅外光譜，條紋振幅可達一到三成，若平場與科學影像的照明光譜不同，條紋無法除掉，天光扣除留下週期性殘差；背面鈍化不良時紫外 QE 隨照光歷史漂移，同一顆星的流量前後不一致。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Using a thin back-illuminated CCD for near-infrared spectroscopy produces fringes of 10% to 30%, and if flat-field and science illumination spectra differ the fringes do not divide out, leaving periodic sky-subtraction residuals; with poor backside passivation ultraviolet QE drifts with illumination history so the same star's flux changes from frame to frame.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以單色儀與可溯源校正光電二極體做比值法，每 10 nm 量一次 QE 並與吸收模型及抗反射膜設計曲線比較；以 1 nm 步進的窄頻平場或可調雷射照射，量測條紋振幅與間距，反推矽層厚度分布；紫外端在不同曝光歷史下重複量測以檢查 QE 遲滯。","textEn":"Measure QE every 10 nm by the ratio method with a monochromator and a traceable calibrated photodiode, comparing with the absorption model and the antireflection design curve; illuminate with narrowband flats stepped by 1 nm or a tunable laser to measure fringe amplitude and spacing and infer the silicon thickness map; repeat ultraviolet measurements after different illumination histories to check for QE hysteresis.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「光電轉換、吸收深度與量子效率」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Photoelectric conversion, absorption depth and quantum efficiency\"?","options":["以單色儀與可溯源校正光電二極體做比值法，每 10 nm 量一次 QE 並與吸收模型及抗反射膜設計曲線比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","像素合併只是軟體後處理，任何感測器效果都一樣。"],"optionsEn":["Measure QE every 10 nm by the ratio method with a monochromator and a traceable calibrated photodiode, comparing with the absorption model and the antireflection design curve.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Binning is only software post-processing and works the same on any sensor."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以單色儀與可溯源校正光電二極體做比值法，每 10 nm 量一次 QE 並與吸收模型及抗反射膜設計曲線比較；以 1 nm 步進的窄頻平場或可調雷射照射，量測條紋振幅與間距，反推矽層厚度分布；紫外端在不同曝光歷史下重複量測以檢查 QE 遲滯。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure QE every 10 nm by the ratio method with a monochromator and a traceable calibrated photodiode, comparing with the absorption model and the antireflection design curve; illuminate with narrowband flats stepped by 1 nm or a tunable laser to measure fringe amplitude and spacing and infer the silicon thickness map; repeat ultraviolet measurements after different illumination histories to check for QE hysteresis. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a479-v12-04","title":"光電轉換、吸收深度與量子效率：失效診斷","titleEn":"Photoelectric conversion, absorption depth and quantum efficiency: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「背照式矽吸收層」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Back-illuminated silicon absorber” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把薄背照式 CCD 用在近紅外光譜，條紋振幅可達一到三成，若平場與科學影像的照明光譜不同，條紋無法除掉，天光扣除留下週期性殘差；背面鈍化不良時紫外 QE 隨照光歷史漂移，同一顆星的流量前後不一致。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Using a thin back-illuminated CCD for near-infrared spectroscopy produces fringes of 10% to 30%, and if flat-field and science illumination spectra differ the fringes do not divide out, leaving periodic sky-subtraction residuals; with poor backside passivation ultraviolet QE drifts with illumination history so the same star's flux changes from frame to frame. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：但矽對紅光與近紅外的吸收長度很長，900 nm 約 33 µm、1000 nm 約 156 µm，薄元件的紅端效率下降，且前後表面反射形成干涉條紋。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: However, silicon's absorption length is long in the red and near infrared, about 33 µm at 900 nm and 156 µm at 1000 nm, so thin devices lose red response and reflections from both surfaces create interference fringes.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「背照式 CCD 在所有波長都有九成以上的量子效率。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A back-illuminated CCD has over 90% QE at every wavelength.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把薄背照式 CCD 用在近紅外光譜，條紋振幅可達一到三成，若平場與科學影像的照明光譜不同，條紋無法除掉，天光扣除留下週期性殘差；背面鈍化不良時紫外 QE 隨照光歷史漂移，同一顆星的流量前後不一致。","textEn":"Using a thin back-illuminated CCD for near-infrared spectroscopy produces fringes of 10% to 30%, and if flat-field and science illumination spectra differ the fringes do not divide out, leaving periodic sky-subtraction residuals; with poor backside passivation ultraviolet QE drifts with illumination history so the same star's flux changes from frame to frame.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「光電轉換、吸收深度與量子效率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Photoelectric conversion, absorption depth and quantum efficiency\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","把薄背照式 CCD 用在近紅外光譜，條紋振幅可達一到三成，若平場與科學影像的照明光譜不同，條紋無法除掉，天光扣除留下週期性殘差。","CTE 為 0.99999 已經接近完美，大面積 CCD 不必再擔心。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Using a thin back-illuminated CCD for near-infrared spectroscopy produces fringes of 10% to 30%, and if flat-field and science illumination spectra differ the fringes do not divide out, leaving periodic sky-subtraction residuals.","A CTE of 0.99999 is essentially perfect even for large CCDs."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把薄背照式 CCD 用在近紅外光譜，條紋振幅可達一到三成，若平場與科學影像的照明光譜不同，條紋無法除掉，天光扣除留下週期性殘差；背面鈍化不良時紫外 QE 隨照光歷史漂移，同一顆星的流量前後不一致。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using a thin back-illuminated CCD for near-infrared spectroscopy produces fringes of 10% to 30%, and if flat-field and science illumination spectra differ the fringes do not divide out, leaving periodic sky-subtraction residuals; with poor backside passivation ultraviolet QE drifts with illumination history so the same star's flux changes from frame to frame. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a479-v12-05","title":"電荷耦合搬運與轉移效率：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Charge-coupled transport and charge-transfer efficiency: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「三相時脈與電荷轉移」如何決定科學級 CCD 成像系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Three-phase clocks and charge transfer” determines the key performance of “Scientific CCD imaging systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"CCD 的每個像素是埋入式通道上的 MOS 電容，曝光時光電子被收集在電極下的電位井中。讀出時以三相時脈依序升降相鄰電極的電壓，把整排電荷包一行一行往水平暫存器平移，再一格一格移到輸出放大器。每次轉移留下的比例稱為電荷轉移無效率 CTI，來源是矽中的缺陷陷阱、太空中質子造成的位移損傷與表面態；陷阱先捕獲電子再延後釋放，使影像沿讀出方向拖尾。CTI 在低訊號、低背景時最嚴重，因為沒有其他電荷先把陷阱填滿。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「三相時脈與電荷轉移」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Each CCD pixel is a MOS capacitor over a buried channel, and during exposure photoelectrons collect in the potential well under the gates. Readout raises and lowers adjacent gate voltages with three-phase clocks so whole rows of charge packets step toward the serial register and then, pixel by pixel, to the output amplifier. The fraction left behind per transfer is the charge-transfer inefficiency CTI, caused by bulk defect traps, proton displacement damage in space and surface states; traps capture electrons and release them later, trailing the image along the readout direction. CTI is worst at low signal and low background because no other charge has filled the traps first. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Three-phase clocks and charge transfer”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：4k × 4k 元件角落像素需 4096 次平行加 4096 次水平轉移，共 8192 次。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A corner pixel of a 4k × 4k device crosses 4096 parallel plus 4096 serial transfers, 8192 in all.","failure":"常見誤解：「CTE 為 0.99999 已經接近完美，大面積 CCD 不必再擔心。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A CTE of 0.99999 is essentially perfect even for large CCDs.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「三相時脈與電荷轉移」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Three-phase clocks and charge transfer”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-05-k1","title":"電荷耦合搬運與轉移效率","titleEn":"Charge-coupled transport and charge-transfer efficiency","text":"CCD 的每個像素是埋入式通道上的 MOS 電容，曝光時光電子被收集在電極下的電位井中。讀出時以三相時脈依序升降相鄰電極的電壓，把整排電荷包一行一行往水平暫存器平移，再一格一格移到輸出放大器。","textEn":"Each CCD pixel is a MOS capacitor over a buried channel, and during exposure photoelectrons collect in the potential well under the gates. Readout raises and lowers adjacent gate voltages with three-phase clocks so whole rows of charge packets step toward the serial register and then, pixel by pixel, to the output amplifier.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：CTE 為 0.99999 已經接近完美，大面積 CCD 不必再擔心。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A CTE of 0.99999 is essentially perfect even for large CCDs. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「電荷耦合搬運與轉移效率」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Charge-coupled transport and charge-transfer efficiency\" is correct?","options":["CTE 為 0.99999 已經接近完美，大面積 CCD 不必再擔心。","讀出雜訊只與晶片有關，與讀出速度無關。","CCD 的每個像素是埋入式通道上的 MOS 電容，曝光時光電子被收集在電極下的電位井中。"],"optionsEn":["A CTE of 0.99999 is essentially perfect even for large CCDs.","Read noise belongs to the chip alone and does not depend on readout speed.","Each CCD pixel is a MOS capacitor over a buried channel, and during exposure photoelectrons collect in the potential well under the gates."],"answer":2,"explanation":"CCD 的每個像素是埋入式通道上的 MOS 電容，曝光時光電子被收集在電極下的電位井中。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Each CCD pixel is a MOS capacitor over a buried channel, and during exposure photoelectrons collect in the potential well under the gates. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a479-v12-06","title":"電荷耦合搬運與轉移效率：定量估算","titleEn":"Charge-coupled transport and charge-transfer efficiency: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「三相時脈與電荷轉移」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Three-phase clocks and charge transfer” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：4k × 4k 元件角落像素需 4096 次平行加 4096 次水平轉移，共 8192 次。CTE = 0.999999 時保留 0.999999⁸¹⁹² = 0.9918，損失 0.82%；CTE = 0.99999 時保留 0.921，損失 7.9%。Fe-55 的 1616 e⁻ X 光事件經 4096 次 CTE = 0.99999 平行轉移剩 1551 e⁻，峰值隨列號線性下降 4%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A corner pixel of a 4k × 4k device crosses 4096 parallel plus 4096 serial transfers, 8192 in all. At CTE = 0.999999 it keeps 0.999999⁸¹⁹² = 0.9918, losing 0.82%; at CTE = 0.99999 it keeps 0.921, losing 7.9%. A 1616 e⁻ Fe-55 X-ray event after 4096 parallel transfers at CTE = 0.99999 retains 1551 e⁻, so the peak falls linearly by 4% across the rows. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以 Fe-55 放射源均勻照射，挑出單像素事件，畫出事件振幅對列號與行號的關係，斜率除以轉移次數即得每次轉移的 CTI；另用延伸像素邊緣響應法，在平場曝光後讀取過掃描區，量最後一行之後溢出的電荷比例；在不同溫度與時脈電壓下重複，找出 CTE 最佳的操作點。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Illuminate uniformly with an Fe-55 source, select single-pixel events and plot event amplitude against row and column number; the slope divided by the transfer count gives CTI per transfer.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"4k × 4k 元件角落像素需 4096 次平行加 4096 次水平轉移，共 8192 次。CTE = 0.999999 時保留 0.999999⁸¹⁹² = 0.9918，損失 0.82%；CTE = 0.99999 時保留 0.921，損失 7.9%。Fe-55 的 1616 e⁻ X 光事件經 4096 次 CTE = 0.99999 平行轉移剩 1551 e⁻，峰值隨列號線性下降 4%。","textEn":"A corner pixel of a 4k × 4k device crosses 4096 parallel plus 4096 serial transfers, 8192 in all. At CTE = 0.999999 it keeps 0.999999⁸¹⁹² = 0.9918, losing 0.82%; at CTE = 0.99999 it keeps 0.921, losing 7.9%. A 1616 e⁻ Fe-55 X-ray event after 4096 parallel transfers at CTE = 0.99999 retains 1551 e⁻, so the peak falls linearly by 4% across the rows.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「電荷耦合搬運與轉移效率」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Charge-coupled transport and charge-transfer efficiency\", which statement holds?","options":["4k × 4k 元件角落像素需 4096 次平行加 4096 次水平轉移，共 8192 次。","溫度越低越好，CCD 冷到最低溫就沒有任何代價。","像素合併只是軟體後處理，任何感測器效果都一樣。"],"optionsEn":["A corner pixel of a 4k × 4k device crosses 4096 parallel plus 4096 serial transfers, 8192 in all.","Colder is always better; cooling a CCD to its minimum has no penalty.","Binning is only software post-processing and works the same on any sensor."],"answer":0,"explanation":"4k × 4k 元件角落像素需 4096 次平行加 4096 次水平轉移，共 8192 次。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A corner pixel of a 4k × 4k device crosses 4096 parallel plus 4096 serial transfers, 8192 in all. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a479-v12-07","title":"電荷耦合搬運與轉移效率：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Charge-coupled transport and charge-transfer efficiency: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「三相時脈與電荷轉移」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Three-phase clocks and charge transfer” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以 Fe-55 放射源均勻照射，挑出單像素事件，畫出事件振幅對列號與行號的關係，斜率除以轉移次數即得每次轉移的 CTI；另用延伸像素邊緣響應法，在平場曝光後讀取過掃描區，量最後一行之後溢出的電荷比例；在不同溫度與時脈電壓下重複，找出 CTE 最佳的操作點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Illuminate uniformly with an Fe-55 source, select single-pixel events and plot event amplitude against row and column number; the slope divided by the transfer count gives CTI per transfer. Use extended pixel edge response as well, reading the overscan after a flat-field exposure to measure the charge that trails beyond the last column; repeat at several temperatures and clock voltages to find the operating point with the best CTE. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：太空任務中質子輻射逐年增加陷阱，暗弱星點的流量損失與質心偏移隨在晶片上的位置而變，測光與天體測量都出現位置相依的系統誤差；若只用亮平場驗收 CTE，低訊號的嚴重拖尾直到科學資料才被發現。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: In space, proton radiation adds traps year by year, so faint stars lose flux and shift centroid depending on their position on the chip, creating position-dependent systematics in both photometry and astrometry; accepting CTE with bright flats only hides the severe low-signal trailing until science data reveal it.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以 Fe-55 放射源均勻照射，挑出單像素事件，畫出事件振幅對列號與行號的關係，斜率除以轉移次數即得每次轉移的 CTI；另用延伸像素邊緣響應法，在平場曝光後讀取過掃描區，量最後一行之後溢出的電荷比例；在不同溫度與時脈電壓下重複，找出 CTE 最佳的操作點。","textEn":"Illuminate uniformly with an Fe-55 source, select single-pixel events and plot event amplitude against row and column number; the slope divided by the transfer count gives CTI per transfer. Use extended pixel edge response as well, reading the overscan after a flat-field exposure to measure the charge that trails beyond the last column; repeat at several temperatures and clock voltages to find the operating point with the best CTE.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「電荷耦合搬運與轉移效率」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Charge-coupled transport and charge-transfer efficiency\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以 Fe-55 放射源均勻照射，挑出單像素事件，畫出事件振幅對列號與行號的關係，斜率除以轉移次數即得每次轉移的 CTI。","出廠規格合格的 CCD，裝進相機後不必再做系統驗收。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Illuminate uniformly with an Fe-55 source, select single-pixel events and plot event amplitude against row and column number.","A CCD that met factory specifications needs no system acceptance once installed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以 Fe-55 放射源均勻照射，挑出單像素事件，畫出事件振幅對列號與行號的關係，斜率除以轉移次數即得每次轉移的 CTI；另用延伸像素邊緣響應法，在平場曝光後讀取過掃描區，量最後一行之後溢出的電荷比例；在不同溫度與時脈電壓下重複，找出 CTE 最佳的操作點。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Illuminate uniformly with an Fe-55 source, select single-pixel events and plot event amplitude against row and column number; the slope divided by the transfer count gives CTI per transfer. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a479-v12-08","title":"電荷耦合搬運與轉移效率：失效診斷","titleEn":"Charge-coupled transport and charge-transfer efficiency: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「三相時脈與電荷轉移」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Three-phase clocks and charge transfer” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"太空任務中質子輻射逐年增加陷阱，暗弱星點的流量損失與質心偏移隨在晶片上的位置而變，測光與天體測量都出現位置相依的系統誤差；若只用亮平場驗收 CTE，低訊號的嚴重拖尾直到科學資料才被發現。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"In space, proton radiation adds traps year by year, so faint stars lose flux and shift centroid depending on their position on the chip, creating position-dependent systematics in both photometry and astrometry; accepting CTE with bright flats only hides the severe low-signal trailing until science data reveal it. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：CTI 在低訊號、低背景時最嚴重，因為沒有其他電荷先把陷阱填滿。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: CTI is worst at low signal and low background because no other charge has filled the traps first.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「CTE 為 0.99999 已經接近完美，大面積 CCD 不必再擔心。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A CTE of 0.99999 is essentially perfect even for large CCDs.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"太空任務中質子輻射逐年增加陷阱，暗弱星點的流量損失與質心偏移隨在晶片上的位置而變，測光與天體測量都出現位置相依的系統誤差；若只用亮平場驗收 CTE，低訊號的嚴重拖尾直到科學資料才被發現。","textEn":"In space, proton radiation adds traps year by year, so faint stars lose flux and shift centroid depending on their position on the chip, creating position-dependent systematics in both photometry and astrometry; accepting CTE with bright flats only hides the severe low-signal trailing until science data reveal it.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「電荷耦合搬運與轉移效率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Charge-coupled transport and charge-transfer efficiency\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","讀出雜訊只與晶片有關，與讀出速度無關。","太空任務中質子輻射逐年增加陷阱，暗弱星點的流量損失與質心偏移隨在晶片上的位置而變，測光與天體測量都出現位置相依的系統誤差。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Read noise belongs to the chip alone and does not depend on readout speed.","In space, proton radiation adds traps year by year, so faint stars lose flux and shift centroid depending on their position on the chip, creating position-dependent systematics in both photometry and astrometry."],"answer":2,"explanation":"太空任務中質子輻射逐年增加陷阱，暗弱星點的流量損失與質心偏移隨在晶片上的位置而變，測光與天體測量都出現位置相依的系統誤差；若只用亮平場驗收 CTE，低訊號的嚴重拖尾直到科學資料才被發現。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"In space, proton radiation adds traps year by year, so faint stars lose flux and shift centroid depending on their position on the chip, creating position-dependent systematics in both photometry and astrometry; accepting CTE with bright flats only hides the severe low-signal trailing until science data reveal it. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a479-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「浮動擴散節點、雙斜率積分與讀出速率」與「背面減薄、深空乏與焦面封裝」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Floating-diffusion node, dual-slope integration and readout rate\" and \"Back-thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane packaging\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a479-v12-09","title":"浮動擴散節點、雙斜率積分與讀出速率：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Floating-diffusion node, dual-slope integration and readout rate: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「浮動擴散輸出放大器」如何決定科學級 CCD 成像系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Floating-diffusion output amplifier” determines the key performance of “Scientific CCD imaging systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"電荷包被倒入輸出端的浮動擴散節點，電容 C 把電荷轉成電壓 q/C，再由源極隨耦器送出晶片。每次倒入電荷前節點要先重設，重設帶來 kTC 雜訊，所以讀出電路在重設後與電荷倒入後各取樣一次並相減，常用雙斜率積分器實作相關雙取樣。讀出雜訊由放大器的白雜訊與 1/f 雜訊組成：取樣時間越長白雜訊越低，但 1/f 雜訊不隨之下降，而且整張影像讀出時間按像素數除以像素速率線性增加。大面積相機因此把晶片分成多個輸出同時讀出。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「浮動擴散輸出放大器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Each charge packet is dumped onto the floating-diffusion node, whose capacitance C converts charge to voltage q/C before a source follower drives it off chip. The node must be reset before every dump and reset introduces kTC noise, so the readout chain samples once after reset and once after the charge transfer and subtracts them, usually with a dual-slope integrator implementing correlated double sampling. Read noise combines amplifier white noise and 1/f noise: longer sampling lowers the white part but not the 1/f part, while frame readout time grows linearly with pixel count divided by pixel rate. Large cameras therefore divide each chip into several outputs read in parallel. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Floating-diffusion output amplifier”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：C = 20 fF 時轉換增益 q/C = 8.0 µV/e⁻；173 K 下的重設雜訊 √(kTC)/q ≈ 43 e⁻，必須靠 CDS 消除。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With C = 20 fF the conversion gain is q/C = 8.0 µV/e⁻; reset noise at 173 K is √(kTC)/q ≈ 43 e⁻ and must be removed by CDS.","failure":"常見誤解：「讀出雜訊只與晶片有關，與讀出速度無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Read noise belongs to the chip alone and does not depend on readout speed.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「浮動擴散輸出放大器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Floating-diffusion output amplifier”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-09-k1","title":"浮動擴散節點、雙斜率積分與讀出速率","titleEn":"Floating-diffusion node, dual-slope integration and readout rate","text":"電荷包被倒入輸出端的浮動擴散節點，電容 C 把電荷轉成電壓 q/C，再由源極隨耦器送出晶片。每次倒入電荷前節點要先重設，重設帶來 kTC 雜訊，所以讀出電路在重設後與電荷倒入後各取樣一次並相減，常用雙斜率積分器實作相關雙取樣。","textEn":"Each charge packet is dumped onto the floating-diffusion node, whose capacitance C converts charge to voltage q/C before a source follower drives it off chip. The node must be reset before every dump and reset introduces kTC noise, so the readout chain samples once after reset and once after the charge transfer and subtracts them, usually with a dual-slope integrator implementing correlated double sampling.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：讀出雜訊只與晶片有關，與讀出速度無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Read noise belongs to the chip alone and does not depend on readout speed. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「浮動擴散節點、雙斜率積分與讀出速率」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Floating-diffusion node, dual-slope integration and readout rate\" is correct?","options":["電荷包被倒入輸出端的浮動擴散節點，電容 C 把電荷轉成電壓 q/C，再由源極隨耦器送出晶片。","讀出雜訊只與晶片有關，與讀出速度無關。","矽越厚越好，因為紅光量子效率一定越高。"],"optionsEn":["Each charge packet is dumped onto the floating-diffusion node, whose capacitance C converts charge to voltage q/C before a source follower drives it off chip.","Read noise belongs to the chip alone and does not depend on readout speed.","Thicker silicon is always better because red QE rises."],"answer":0,"explanation":"電荷包被倒入輸出端的浮動擴散節點，電容 C 把電荷轉成電壓 q/C，再由源極隨耦器送出晶片。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Each charge packet is dumped onto the floating-diffusion node, whose capacitance C converts charge to voltage q/C before a source follower drives it off chip. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a479-v12-10","title":"浮動擴散節點、雙斜率積分與讀出速率：定量估算","titleEn":"Floating-diffusion node, dual-slope integration and readout rate: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「浮動擴散輸出放大器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Floating-diffusion output amplifier” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：C = 20 fF 時轉換增益 q/C = 8.0 µV/e⁻；173 K 下的重設雜訊 √(kTC)/q ≈ 43 e⁻，必須靠 CDS 消除。公開深冷相機規格列出 50 kHz 讀出 2.9 e⁻、1 MHz 為 7.0 e⁻，比值 2.4 小於純白雜訊的 √20 = 4.47，顯示 1/f 與固定項。2048² 像素以 1 MHz 讀出 4.2 s、50 kHz 需 84 s；4k × 4k 晶片分 16 個輸出、2 s 讀完，每輸出約 524 kHz。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With C = 20 fF the conversion gain is q/C = 8.0 µV/e⁻; reset noise at 173 K is √(kTC)/q ≈ 43 e⁻ and must be removed by CDS. A public deep-cooled camera datasheet lists 2.9 e⁻ at 50 kHz and 7.0 e⁻ at 1 MHz, a ratio of 2.4 rather than the √20 = 4.47 of pure white noise, revealing 1/f and fixed terms. 2048² pixels read in 4.2 s at 1 MHz but 84 s at 50 kHz; a 4k × 4k chip split into 16 outputs read in 2 s needs about 524 kHz per output. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在暗環境下以最短曝光取兩張偏壓影像相減，差值標準差除以 √2 再乘以增益即得讀出雜訊；在多個像素速率重複，畫出雜訊對取樣時間的曲線並擬合白雜訊與 1/f 項；以示波器檢查輸出波形的重設與訊號平台是否穩定，確認積分窗未落在時脈突波上。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Take two minimum-exposure bias frames in darkness and subtract them; the standard deviation of the difference divided by √2 and multiplied by the gain gives read noise.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"C = 20 fF 時轉換增益 q/C = 8.0 µV/e⁻；173 K 下的重設雜訊 √(kTC)/q ≈ 43 e⁻，必須靠 CDS 消除。公開深冷相機規格列出 50 kHz 讀出 2.9 e⁻、1 MHz 為 7.0 e⁻，比值 2.4 小於純白雜訊的 √20 = 4.47，顯示 1/f 與固定項。2048² 像素以 1 MHz 讀出 4.2 s、50 kHz 需 84 s；4k × 4k 晶片分 16 個輸出、2 s 讀完，每輸出約 524 kHz。","textEn":"With C = 20 fF the conversion gain is q/C = 8.0 µV/e⁻; reset noise at 173 K is √(kTC)/q ≈ 43 e⁻ and must be removed by CDS. A public deep-cooled camera datasheet lists 2.9 e⁻ at 50 kHz and 7.0 e⁻ at 1 MHz, a ratio of 2.4 rather than the √20 = 4.47 of pure white noise, revealing 1/f and fixed terms. 2048² pixels read in 4.2 s at 1 MHz but 84 s at 50 kHz; a 4k × 4k chip split into 16 outputs read in 2 s needs about 524 kHz per output.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「浮動擴散節點、雙斜率積分與讀出速率」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Floating-diffusion node, dual-slope integration and readout rate\", which statement holds?","options":["增益就是 ADC 位元數除以滿井，不需量測。","C = 20 fF 時轉換增益 q/C = 8.0 µV/e⁻；173 K 下的重設雜訊 √(kTC)/q ≈ 43 e⁻，必須靠 CDS 消除。","出廠規格合格的 CCD，裝進相機後不必再做系統驗收。"],"optionsEn":["Gain is simply full well divided by ADC range and needs no measurement.","With C = 20 fF the conversion gain is q/C = 8.0 µV/e⁻; reset noise at 173 K is √(kTC)/q ≈ 43 e⁻ and must be removed by CDS.","A CCD that met factory specifications needs no system acceptance once installed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"C = 20 fF 時轉換增益 q/C = 8.0 µV/e⁻；173 K 下的重設雜訊 √(kTC)/q ≈ 43 e⁻，必須靠 CDS 消除。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With C = 20 fF the conversion gain is q/C = 8.0 µV/e⁻; reset noise at 173 K is √(kTC)/q ≈ 43 e⁻ and must be removed by CDS. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a479-v12-11","title":"浮動擴散節點、雙斜率積分與讀出速率：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Floating-diffusion node, dual-slope integration and readout rate: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「浮動擴散輸出放大器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Floating-diffusion output amplifier” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在暗環境下以最短曝光取兩張偏壓影像相減，差值標準差除以 √2 再乘以增益即得讀出雜訊；在多個像素速率重複，畫出雜訊對取樣時間的曲線並擬合白雜訊與 1/f 項；以示波器檢查輸出波形的重設與訊號平台是否穩定，確認積分窗未落在時脈突波上。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Take two minimum-exposure bias frames in darkness and subtract them; the standard deviation of the difference divided by √2 and multiplied by the gain gives read noise. Repeat at several pixel rates, plot noise versus sampling time and fit white and 1/f terms; inspect the output waveform on an oscilloscope to confirm stable reset and signal plateaus and that integration windows avoid clock feedthrough spikes. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了縮短讀出時間把像素速率提高而沒有調整積分窗，取樣落在時脈突波上，讀出雜訊翻倍且出現與列相關的圖樣；輸出電晶體在曝光期間持續開啟時，其熱電子發光在靠近輸出的角落形成放大器輝光。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Raising the pixel rate to shorten readout without retuning the integration windows puts samples on clock feedthrough, doubling read noise and adding row-correlated patterns; leaving the output transistor on during exposure makes its hot-carrier emission glow in the corner nearest the output.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在暗環境下以最短曝光取兩張偏壓影像相減，差值標準差除以 √2 再乘以增益即得讀出雜訊；在多個像素速率重複，畫出雜訊對取樣時間的曲線並擬合白雜訊與 1/f 項；以示波器檢查輸出波形的重設與訊號平台是否穩定，確認積分窗未落在時脈突波上。","textEn":"Take two minimum-exposure bias frames in darkness and subtract them; the standard deviation of the difference divided by √2 and multiplied by the gain gives read noise. Repeat at several pixel rates, plot noise versus sampling time and fit white and 1/f terms; inspect the output waveform on an oscilloscope to confirm stable reset and signal plateaus and that integration windows avoid clock feedthrough spikes.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「浮動擴散節點、雙斜率積分與讀出速率」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Floating-diffusion node, dual-slope integration and readout rate\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","背照式 CCD 在所有波長都有九成以上的量子效率。","在暗環境下以最短曝光取兩張偏壓影像相減，差值標準差除以 √2 再乘以增益即得讀出雜訊。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","A back-illuminated CCD has over 90% QE at every wavelength.","Take two minimum-exposure bias frames in darkness and subtract them."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在暗環境下以最短曝光取兩張偏壓影像相減，差值標準差除以 √2 再乘以增益即得讀出雜訊；在多個像素速率重複，畫出雜訊對取樣時間的曲線並擬合白雜訊與 1/f 項；以示波器檢查輸出波形的重設與訊號平台是否穩定，確認積分窗未落在時脈突波上。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Take two minimum-exposure bias frames in darkness and subtract them; the standard deviation of the difference divided by √2 and multiplied by the gain gives read noise. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a479-v12-12","title":"浮動擴散節點、雙斜率積分與讀出速率：失效診斷","titleEn":"Floating-diffusion node, dual-slope integration and readout rate: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「浮動擴散輸出放大器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Floating-diffusion output amplifier” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了縮短讀出時間把像素速率提高而沒有調整積分窗，取樣落在時脈突波上，讀出雜訊翻倍且出現與列相關的圖樣；輸出電晶體在曝光期間持續開啟時，其熱電子發光在靠近輸出的角落形成放大器輝光。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Raising the pixel rate to shorten readout without retuning the integration windows puts samples on clock feedthrough, doubling read noise and adding row-correlated patterns; leaving the output transistor on during exposure makes its hot-carrier emission glow in the corner nearest the output. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：大面積相機因此把晶片分成多個輸出同時讀出。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Large cameras therefore divide each chip into several outputs read in parallel.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「讀出雜訊只與晶片有關，與讀出速度無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Read noise belongs to the chip alone and does not depend on readout speed.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了縮短讀出時間把像素速率提高而沒有調整積分窗，取樣落在時脈突波上，讀出雜訊翻倍且出現與列相關的圖樣；輸出電晶體在曝光期間持續開啟時，其熱電子發光在靠近輸出的角落形成放大器輝光。","textEn":"Raising the pixel rate to shorten readout without retuning the integration windows puts samples on clock feedthrough, doubling read noise and adding row-correlated patterns; leaving the output transistor on during exposure makes its hot-carrier emission glow in the corner nearest the output.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「浮動擴散節點、雙斜率積分與讀出速率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Floating-diffusion node, dual-slope integration and readout rate\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["為了縮短讀出時間把像素速率提高而沒有調整積分窗，取樣落在時脈突波上，讀出雜訊翻倍且出現與列相關的圖樣。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","矽越厚越好，因為紅光量子效率一定越高。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the pixel rate to shorten readout without retuning the integration windows puts samples on clock feedthrough, doubling read noise and adding row-correlated patterns.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Thicker silicon is always better because red QE rises."],"answer":0,"explanation":"為了縮短讀出時間把像素速率提高而沒有調整積分窗，取樣落在時脈突波上，讀出雜訊翻倍且出現與列相關的圖樣；輸出電晶體在曝光期間持續開啟時，其熱電子發光在靠近輸出的角落形成放大器輝光。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Raising the pixel rate to shorten readout without retuning the integration windows puts samples on clock feedthrough, doubling read noise and adding row-correlated patterns; leaving the output transistor on during exposure makes its hot-carrier emission glow in the corner nearest the output. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a479-v12-13","title":"背面減薄、深空乏與焦面封裝：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Back-thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane packaging: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「減薄、深空乏與焦面平整度」如何決定科學級 CCD 成像系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane flatness” determines the key performance of “Scientific CCD imaging systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"背照式 CCD 把晶圓減薄到 10 到 20 µm，背面必須以離子佈植加雷射退火、分子束磊晶 δ 摻雜等方式鈍化，建立把光電子推向前側電位井的內建電場，否則藍光產生的電子在背面復合。深空乏元件改用高電阻率矽並施加基板偏壓，使 40 到 200 µm 厚的矽全部空乏，紅端 QE 提高且條紋減弱，但未空乏區的電荷橫向擴散會放大點擴散函數，宇宙射線徑跡也變長。大面積焦面由多片晶片拼成，封裝要控制平整度、間隙與低溫下的熱膨脹匹配。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「減薄、深空乏與焦面平整度」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Back-illuminated CCDs thin the wafer to 10 to 20 µm, and the back surface must be passivated by ion implantation with laser annealing or molecular-beam-epitaxy delta doping to build a field that drives photoelectrons toward the front-side wells; otherwise electrons generated by blue light recombine at the surface. Deep-depletion devices use high-resistivity silicon and a substrate bias to deplete 40 to 200 µm fully, raising red QE and suppressing fringes, but lateral diffusion from any undepleted region broadens the point-spread function and cosmic-ray tracks lengthen. Large focal planes tile many chips, so packaging must control flatness, gaps and thermal-expansion matching at cryogenic temperature. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane flatness”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：空乏深度 W = √(2ε_Si·V/(q·N_A))：ε_Si = 1.04×10⁻¹⁰ F/m、V = 20 V、N_A = 5×10¹² cm⁻³ 時 W = √(2×1.04×10⁻¹⁰×20/(1.6×10⁻¹⁹×5×10¹⁸)) ≈ 72 µm；N_A 降到 1×10¹² cm⁻³ 時約 161 µm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Depletion depth W = √(2ε_Si·V/(q·N_A)): with ε_Si = 1.04×10⁻¹⁰ F/m, V = 20 V and N_A = 5×10¹² cm⁻³, W = √(2×1.04×10⁻¹⁰×20/(1.6×10⁻¹⁹×5×10¹⁸)) ≈ 72 µm, rising to about 161 µm at N_A = 1×10¹² cm⁻³.","failure":"常見誤解：「矽越厚越好，因為紅光量子效率一定越高。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Thicker silicon is always better because red QE rises.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「減薄、深空乏與焦面平整度」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane flatness”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-13-k1","title":"背面減薄、深空乏與焦面封裝","titleEn":"Back-thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane packaging","text":"背照式 CCD 把晶圓減薄到 10 到 20 µm，背面必須以離子佈植加雷射退火、分子束磊晶 δ 摻雜等方式鈍化，建立把光電子推向前側電位井的內建電場，否則藍光產生的電子在背面復合。深空乏元件改用高電阻率矽並施加基板偏壓，使 40 到 200 µm 厚的矽全部空乏，紅端 QE 提高且條紋減弱，但未空乏區的電荷橫向擴散會放大點擴散函數，宇宙射線徑跡也變長。","textEn":"Back-illuminated CCDs thin the wafer to 10 to 20 µm, and the back surface must be passivated by ion implantation with laser annealing or molecular-beam-epitaxy delta doping to build a field that drives photoelectrons toward the front-side wells; otherwise electrons generated by blue light recombine at the surface. Deep-depletion devices use high-resistivity silicon and a substrate bias to deplete 40 to 200 µm fully, raising red QE and suppressing fringes, but lateral diffusion from any undepleted region broadens the point-spread function and cosmic-ray tracks lengthen.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：矽越厚越好，因為紅光量子效率一定越高。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Thicker silicon is always better because red QE rises. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「背面減薄、深空乏與焦面封裝」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Back-thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane packaging\" is correct?","options":["矽越厚越好，因為紅光量子效率一定越高。","背照式 CCD 把晶圓減薄到 10 到 20 µm，背面必須以離子佈植加雷射退火、分子束磊晶 δ 摻雜等方式鈍化，建立把光電子推向前側電位井的內建電場，否則藍光產生的電子在背面復合。","溫度越低越好，CCD 冷到最低溫就沒有任何代價。"],"optionsEn":["Thicker silicon is always better because red QE rises.","Back-illuminated CCDs thin the wafer to 10 to 20 µm, and the back surface must be passivated by ion implantation with laser annealing or molecular-beam-epitaxy delta doping to build a field that drives photoelectrons toward the front-side wells.","Colder is always better; cooling a CCD to its minimum has no penalty."],"answer":1,"explanation":"背照式 CCD 把晶圓減薄到 10 到 20 µm，背面必須以離子佈植加雷射退火、分子束磊晶 δ 摻雜等方式鈍化，建立把光電子推向前側電位井的內建電場，否則藍光產生的電子在背面復合。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Back-illuminated CCDs thin the wafer to 10 to 20 µm, and the back surface must be passivated by ion implantation with laser annealing or molecular-beam-epitaxy delta doping to build a field that drives photoelectrons toward the front-side wells; otherwise electrons generated by blue light recombine at the surface. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a479-v12-14","title":"背面減薄、深空乏與焦面封裝：定量估算","titleEn":"Back-thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane packaging: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「減薄、深空乏與焦面平整度」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane flatness” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：空乏深度 W = √(2ε_Si·V/(q·N_A))：ε_Si = 1.04×10⁻¹⁰ F/m、V = 20 V、N_A = 5×10¹² cm⁻³ 時 W = √(2×1.04×10⁻¹⁰×20/(1.6×10⁻¹⁹×5×10¹⁸)) ≈ 72 µm；N_A 降到 1×10¹² cm⁻³ 時約 161 µm。平整度：f/1.23 的快速光束中 10 µm 離焦造成 10/1.23 ≈ 8.1 µm 的模糊圈，約 0.8 個 10 µm 像素。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Depletion depth W = √(2ε_Si·V/(q·N_A)): with ε_Si = 1.04×10⁻¹⁰ F/m, V = 20 V and N_A = 5×10¹² cm⁻³, W = √(2×1.04×10⁻¹⁰×20/(1.6×10⁻¹⁹×5×10¹⁸)) ≈ 72 µm, rising to about 161 µm at N_A = 1×10¹² cm⁻³. Flatness: in a fast f/1.23 beam a 10 µm defocus blurs to 10/1.23 ≈ 8.1 µm, about 0.8 of a 10 µm pixel. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在工作溫度下以非接觸式雷射三角量測或干涉儀量測每片晶片與整個焦面的高度圖，比較峰谷值與景深預算；以點光源投射器在多個波長掃描焦面，量測點擴散函數寬度隨基板偏壓的變化，確認元件已完全空乏；逐片記錄晶片間隙與方向。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: At operating temperature, map the height of every chip and of the full focal plane with non-contact laser triangulation or interferometry, comparing peak-to-valley with the depth-of-focus budget; scan the focal plane with a spot projector at several wavelengths and measure point-spread-function width versus substrate bias to confirm full depletion; record each chip's gaps and orientation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"空乏深度 W = √(2ε_Si·V/(q·N_A))：ε_Si = 1.04×10⁻¹⁰ F/m、V = 20 V、N_A = 5×10¹² cm⁻³ 時 W = √(2×1.04×10⁻¹⁰×20/(1.6×10⁻¹⁹×5×10¹⁸)) ≈ 72 µm；N_A 降到 1×10¹² cm⁻³ 時約 161 µm。平整度：f/1.23 的快速光束中 10 µm 離焦造成 10/1.23 ≈ 8.1 µm 的模糊圈，約 0.8 個 10 µm 像素。","textEn":"Depletion depth W = √(2ε_Si·V/(q·N_A)): with ε_Si = 1.04×10⁻¹⁰ F/m, V = 20 V and N_A = 5×10¹² cm⁻³, W = √(2×1.04×10⁻¹⁰×20/(1.6×10⁻¹⁹×5×10¹⁸)) ≈ 72 µm, rising to about 161 µm at N_A = 1×10¹² cm⁻³. Flatness: in a fast f/1.23 beam a 10 µm defocus blurs to 10/1.23 ≈ 8.1 µm, about 0.8 of a 10 µm pixel.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「背面減薄、深空乏與焦面封裝」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Back-thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane packaging\", which statement holds?","options":["像素合併只是軟體後處理，任何感測器效果都一樣。","背照式 CCD 在所有波長都有九成以上的量子效率。","空乏深度 W = √(2ε_Si·V/(q·N_A))：ε_Si = 1.04×10⁻¹⁰ F/m、V = 20 V、N_A = 5×10¹² cm⁻³ 時 W = √(2×1.04×10⁻¹⁰×20/(1.6×10⁻¹⁹×5×10¹⁸)) ≈ 72 µm。"],"optionsEn":["Binning is only software post-processing and works the same on any sensor.","A back-illuminated CCD has over 90% QE at every wavelength.","Depletion depth W = √(2ε_Si·V/(q·N_A)): with ε_Si = 1.04×10⁻¹⁰ F/m, V = 20 V and N_A = 5×10¹² cm⁻³, W = √(2×1.04×10⁻¹⁰×20/(1.6×10⁻¹⁹×5×10¹⁸)) ≈ 72 µm, rising to about 161 µm at N_A = 1×10¹² cm⁻³."],"answer":2,"explanation":"空乏深度 W = √(2ε_Si·V/(q·N_A))：ε_Si = 1.04×10⁻¹⁰ F/m、V = 20 V、N_A = 5×10¹² cm⁻³ 時 W = √(2×1.04×10⁻¹⁰×20/(1.6×10⁻¹⁹×5×10¹⁸)) ≈ 72 µm；N_A 降到 1×10¹² cm⁻³ 時約 161 µm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Depletion depth W = √(2ε_Si·V/(q·N_A)): with ε_Si = 1.04×10⁻¹⁰ F/m, V = 20 V and N_A = 5×10¹² cm⁻³, W = √(2×1.04×10⁻¹⁰×20/(1.6×10⁻¹⁹×5×10¹⁸)) ≈ 72 µm, rising to about 161 µm at N_A = 1×10¹² cm⁻³. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a479-v12-15","title":"背面減薄、深空乏與焦面封裝：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Back-thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane packaging: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「減薄、深空乏與焦面平整度」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane flatness” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在工作溫度下以非接觸式雷射三角量測或干涉儀量測每片晶片與整個焦面的高度圖，比較峰谷值與景深預算；以點光源投射器在多個波長掃描焦面，量測點擴散函數寬度隨基板偏壓的變化，確認元件已完全空乏；逐片記錄晶片間隙與方向。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"At operating temperature, map the height of every chip and of the full focal plane with non-contact laser triangulation or interferometry, comparing peak-to-valley with the depth-of-focus budget; scan the focal plane with a spot projector at several wavelengths and measure point-spread-function width versus substrate bias to confirm full depletion; record each chip's gaps and orientation. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：基板偏壓不足時元件只部分空乏，紅光在未空乏區產生的電荷橫向擴散，點擴散函數隨波長變寬，弱重力透鏡等形狀量測出現色相依的偏差；封裝材料與矽的熱膨脹不匹配，降溫後晶片翹曲數十微米，視場邊緣影像失焦。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Insufficient substrate bias leaves the device partially depleted, charge from red light diffuses laterally in the undepleted region and the point-spread function broadens with wavelength, biasing shape measurements such as weak lensing in a colour-dependent way; a package whose expansion mismatches silicon bows the chip by tens of micrometres on cooldown and defocuses the field edges.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在工作溫度下以非接觸式雷射三角量測或干涉儀量測每片晶片與整個焦面的高度圖，比較峰谷值與景深預算；以點光源投射器在多個波長掃描焦面，量測點擴散函數寬度隨基板偏壓的變化，確認元件已完全空乏；逐片記錄晶片間隙與方向。","textEn":"At operating temperature, map the height of every chip and of the full focal plane with non-contact laser triangulation or interferometry, comparing peak-to-valley with the depth-of-focus budget; scan the focal plane with a spot projector at several wavelengths and measure point-spread-function width versus substrate bias to confirm full depletion; record each chip's gaps and orientation.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「背面減薄、深空乏與焦面封裝」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Back-thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane packaging\"?","options":["在工作溫度下以非接觸式雷射三角量測或干涉儀量測每片晶片與整個焦面的高度圖，比較峰谷值與景深預算。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","CTE 為 0.99999 已經接近完美，大面積 CCD 不必再擔心。"],"optionsEn":["At operating temperature, map the height of every chip and of the full focal plane with non-contact laser triangulation or interferometry, comparing peak-to-valley with the depth-of-focus budget.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A CTE of 0.99999 is essentially perfect even for large CCDs."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在工作溫度下以非接觸式雷射三角量測或干涉儀量測每片晶片與整個焦面的高度圖，比較峰谷值與景深預算；以點光源投射器在多個波長掃描焦面，量測點擴散函數寬度隨基板偏壓的變化，確認元件已完全空乏；逐片記錄晶片間隙與方向。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"At operating temperature, map the height of every chip and of the full focal plane with non-contact laser triangulation or interferometry, comparing peak-to-valley with the depth-of-focus budget; scan the focal plane with a spot projector at several wavelengths and measure point-spread-function width versus substrate bias to confirm full depletion; record each chip's gaps and orientation. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a479-v12-16","title":"背面減薄、深空乏與焦面封裝：失效診斷","titleEn":"Back-thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane packaging: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「減薄、深空乏與焦面平整度」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane flatness” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"基板偏壓不足時元件只部分空乏，紅光在未空乏區產生的電荷橫向擴散，點擴散函數隨波長變寬，弱重力透鏡等形狀量測出現色相依的偏差；封裝材料與矽的熱膨脹不匹配，降溫後晶片翹曲數十微米，視場邊緣影像失焦。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Insufficient substrate bias leaves the device partially depleted, charge from red light diffuses laterally in the undepleted region and the point-spread function broadens with wavelength, biasing shape measurements such as weak lensing in a colour-dependent way; a package whose expansion mismatches silicon bows the chip by tens of micrometres on cooldown and defocuses the field edges. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：大面積焦面由多片晶片拼成，封裝要控制平整度、間隙與低溫下的熱膨脹匹配。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Large focal planes tile many chips, so packaging must control flatness, gaps and thermal-expansion matching at cryogenic temperature.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「矽越厚越好，因為紅光量子效率一定越高。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Thicker silicon is always better because red QE rises.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"基板偏壓不足時元件只部分空乏，紅光在未空乏區產生的電荷橫向擴散，點擴散函數隨波長變寬，弱重力透鏡等形狀量測出現色相依的偏差；封裝材料與矽的熱膨脹不匹配，降溫後晶片翹曲數十微米，視場邊緣影像失焦。","textEn":"Insufficient substrate bias leaves the device partially depleted, charge from red light diffuses laterally in the undepleted region and the point-spread function broadens with wavelength, biasing shape measurements such as weak lensing in a colour-dependent way; a package whose expansion mismatches silicon bows the chip by tens of micrometres on cooldown and defocuses the field edges.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「背面減薄、深空乏與焦面封裝」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Back-thinning, deep depletion and focal-plane packaging\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","基板偏壓不足時元件只部分空乏，紅光在未空乏區產生的電荷橫向擴散，點擴散函數隨波長變寬，弱重力透鏡等形狀量測出現色相依的偏差。","溫度越低越好，CCD 冷到最低溫就沒有任何代價。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Insufficient substrate bias leaves the device partially depleted, charge from red light diffuses laterally in the undepleted region and the point-spread function broadens with wavelength, biasing shape measurements such as weak lensing in a colour-dependent way.","Colder is always better; cooling a CCD to its minimum has no penalty."],"answer":1,"explanation":"基板偏壓不足時元件只部分空乏，紅光在未空乏區產生的電荷橫向擴散，點擴散函數隨波長變寬，弱重力透鏡等形狀量測出現色相依的偏差；封裝材料與矽的熱膨脹不匹配，降溫後晶片翹曲數十微米，視場邊緣影像失焦。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Insufficient substrate bias leaves the device partially depleted, charge from red light diffuses laterally in the undepleted region and the point-spread function broadens with wavelength, biasing shape measurements such as weak lensing in a colour-dependent way; a package whose expansion mismatches silicon bows the chip by tens of micrometres on cooldown and defocuses the field edges. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a479-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「暗電流的溫度依存與冷卻設計」與「光子轉移曲線與 Fe-55 增益校正」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Temperature dependence of dark current and cooling design\" and \"Photon transfer curve and Fe-55 gain calibration\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a479-v12-17","title":"暗電流的溫度依存與冷卻設計：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Temperature dependence of dark current and cooling design: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「低溫恆溫器與暗電流」如何決定科學級 CCD 成像系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Cryostat and dark current” determines the key performance of “Scientific CCD imaging systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"暗電流來自熱激發的電子電洞對：空乏區的產生電流按 T^1.5·exp(−E_g/2kT) 變化，未空乏區的擴散電流按 T³·exp(−E_g/kT) 變化，矽與氧化層界面的表面態則在非反轉模式下貢獻最多。多釘扎相位（MPP）操作讓表面反轉，可把表面暗電流壓低約百倍。實驗室相機以多級熱電致冷到 −70 到 −100 °C，天文台常用液氮或閉循環冷頭到 −100 °C 以下；但溫度太低時部分陷阱釋放時間變長而使 CTE 變差，暗電流也會被時脈感應電荷與輝光等其他來源墊底。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「低溫恆溫器與暗電流」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Dark current comes from thermally generated electron–hole pairs: depletion-region generation scales as T^1.5·exp(−E_g/2kT), diffusion from undepleted silicon as T³·exp(−E_g/kT), and surface states at the silicon–oxide interface contribute most in non-inverted operation. Multi-pinned-phase (MPP) operation inverts the surface and suppresses surface dark current by roughly a hundredfold. Laboratory cameras use multistage thermoelectric coolers to reach −70 to −100 °C, and observatories use liquid nitrogen or closed-cycle cold heads below −100 °C; too cold, however, lengthens some trap emission times and worsens CTE, and dark current is floored by other sources such as clock-induced charge and glow. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Cryostat and dark current”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：公開規格：−70 °C 為 0.0004、−80 °C 為 0.00013 e⁻/px/s，每 10 K 相差 3.08 倍，即每 10×ln2/ln3.08 ≈ 6.2 K 減半；−100 °C 為 0.000059，20 K 只降 2.2 倍，已接近底限。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Public specifications give 0.0004 e⁻/px/s at −70 °C and 0.00013 at −80 °C, a factor of 3.08 per 10 K, i.e. halving every 10×ln2/ln3.08 ≈ 6.2 K; at −100 °C the value is 0.000059, only 2.2 times lower over 20 K, near the floor.","failure":"常見誤解：「溫度越低越好，CCD 冷到最低溫就沒有任何代價。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Colder is always better; cooling a CCD to its minimum has no penalty.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「低溫恆溫器與暗電流」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Cryostat and dark current”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-17-k1","title":"暗電流的溫度依存與冷卻設計","titleEn":"Temperature dependence of dark current and cooling design","text":"暗電流來自熱激發的電子電洞對：空乏區的產生電流按 T^1.5·exp(−E_g/2kT) 變化，未空乏區的擴散電流按 T³·exp(−E_g/kT) 變化，矽與氧化層界面的表面態則在非反轉模式下貢獻最多。多釘扎相位（MPP）操作讓表面反轉，可把表面暗電流壓低約百倍。","textEn":"Dark current comes from thermally generated electron–hole pairs: depletion-region generation scales as T^1.5·exp(−E_g/2kT), diffusion from undepleted silicon as T³·exp(−E_g/kT), and surface states at the silicon–oxide interface contribute most in non-inverted operation. Multi-pinned-phase (MPP) operation inverts the surface and suppresses surface dark current by roughly a hundredfold.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：溫度越低越好，CCD 冷到最低溫就沒有任何代價。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Colder is always better; cooling a CCD to its minimum has no penalty. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「暗電流的溫度依存與冷卻設計」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Temperature dependence of dark current and cooling design\" is correct?","options":["溫度越低越好，CCD 冷到最低溫就沒有任何代價。","增益就是 ADC 位元數除以滿井，不需量測。","暗電流來自熱激發的電子電洞對：空乏區的產生電流按 T^1.5·exp(−E_g/2kT) 變化，未空乏區的擴散電流按 T³·exp(−E_g/kT) 變化，矽與氧化層界面的表面態則在非反轉模式下貢獻最多。"],"optionsEn":["Colder is always better; cooling a CCD to its minimum has no penalty.","Gain is simply full well divided by ADC range and needs no measurement.","Dark current comes from thermally generated electron–hole pairs: depletion-region generation scales as T^1.5·exp(−E_g/2kT), diffusion from undepleted silicon as T³·exp(−E_g/kT), and surface states at the silicon–oxide interface contribute most in non-inverted operation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"暗電流來自熱激發的電子電洞對：空乏區的產生電流按 T^1.5·exp(−E_g/2kT) 變化，未空乏區的擴散電流按 T³·exp(−E_g/kT) 變化，矽與氧化層界面的表面態則在非反轉模式下貢獻最多。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Dark current comes from thermally generated electron–hole pairs: depletion-region generation scales as T^1.5·exp(−E_g/2kT), diffusion from undepleted silicon as T³·exp(−E_g/kT), and surface states at the silicon–oxide interface contribute most in non-inverted operation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a479-v12-18","title":"暗電流的溫度依存與冷卻設計：定量估算","titleEn":"Temperature dependence of dark current and cooling design: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「低溫恆溫器與暗電流」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Cryostat and dark current” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：公開規格：−70 °C 為 0.0004、−80 °C 為 0.00013 e⁻/px/s，每 10 K 相差 3.08 倍，即每 10×ln2/ln3.08 ≈ 6.2 K 減半；−100 °C 為 0.000059，20 K 只降 2.2 倍，已接近底限。1800 s 曝光在 −80 °C 累積 0.23 e⁻，散粒雜訊 0.48 e⁻ 遠小於 2.9 e⁻ 讀出雜訊；外推到 −40 °C 約 0.012 e⁻/px/s，累積 21 e⁻、雜訊 4.6 e⁻，超過讀出雜訊。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Public specifications give 0.0004 e⁻/px/s at −70 °C and 0.00013 at −80 °C, a factor of 3.08 per 10 K, i.e. halving every 10×ln2/ln3.08 ≈ 6.2 K; at −100 °C the value is 0.000059, only 2.2 times lower over 20 K, near the floor. A 1800 s exposure at −80 °C accumulates 0.23 e⁻ with 0.48 e⁻ shot noise, far below 2.9 e⁻ read noise; extrapolated to −40 °C the rate is about 0.012 e⁻/px/s, giving 21 e⁻ and 4.6 e⁻ noise, above the read noise. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在至少四個溫度、各三種曝光時間取暗場，逐像素擬合斜率得暗電流，畫 ln(D) 對 1/T 的 Arrhenius 圖求活化能，判斷是產生、擴散或表面機制主導；以快門關閉與鏡頭完全遮蓋兩種方式比較，排除漏光；建立熱像素地圖並記錄角落是否有放大器輝光。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Take darks at four or more temperatures with three exposure times each, fit the per-pixel slope to obtain dark current, and plot ln(D) against 1/T in an Arrhenius plot to find the activation energy and decide whether generation, diffusion or surface mechanisms dominate; compare shutter-closed with fully capped darks to rule out light leaks; build a hot-pixel map and note any amplifier glow at the corners.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"公開規格：−70 °C 為 0.0004、−80 °C 為 0.00013 e⁻/px/s，每 10 K 相差 3.08 倍，即每 10×ln2/ln3.08 ≈ 6.2 K 減半；−100 °C 為 0.000059，20 K 只降 2.2 倍，已接近底限。1800 s 曝光在 −80 °C 累積 0.23 e⁻，散粒雜訊 0.48 e⁻ 遠小於 2.9 e⁻ 讀出雜訊；外推到 −40 °C 約 0.012 e⁻/px/s，累積 21 e⁻、雜訊 4.6 e⁻，超過讀出雜訊。","textEn":"Public specifications give 0.0004 e⁻/px/s at −70 °C and 0.00013 at −80 °C, a factor of 3.08 per 10 K, i.e. halving every 10×ln2/ln3.08 ≈ 6.2 K; at −100 °C the value is 0.000059, only 2.2 times lower over 20 K, near the floor. A 1800 s exposure at −80 °C accumulates 0.23 e⁻ with 0.48 e⁻ shot noise, far below 2.9 e⁻ read noise; extrapolated to −40 °C the rate is about 0.012 e⁻/px/s, giving 21 e⁻ and 4.6 e⁻ noise, above the read noise.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「暗電流的溫度依存與冷卻設計」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Temperature dependence of dark current and cooling design\", which statement holds?","options":["公開規格：−70 °C 為 0.0004、−80 °C 為 0.00013 e⁻/px/s，每 10 K 相差 3.08 倍，即每 10×ln2/ln3.08 ≈ 6.2 K 減半。","出廠規格合格的 CCD，裝進相機後不必再做系統驗收。","CTE 為 0.99999 已經接近完美，大面積 CCD 不必再擔心。"],"optionsEn":["Public specifications give 0.0004 e⁻/px/s at −70 °C and 0.00013 at −80 °C, a factor of 3.08 per 10 K, i.e. halving every 10×ln2/ln3.08 ≈ 6.2 K.","A CCD that met factory specifications needs no system acceptance once installed.","A CTE of 0.99999 is essentially perfect even for large CCDs."],"answer":0,"explanation":"公開規格：−70 °C 為 0.0004、−80 °C 為 0.00013 e⁻/px/s，每 10 K 相差 3.08 倍，即每 10×ln2/ln3.08 ≈ 6.2 K 減半；−100 °C 為 0.000059，20 K 只降 2.2 倍，已接近底限。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Public specifications give 0.0004 e⁻/px/s at −70 °C and 0.00013 at −80 °C, a factor of 3.08 per 10 K, i.e. halving every 10×ln2/ln3.08 ≈ 6.2 K; at −100 °C the value is 0.000059, only 2.2 times lower over 20 K, near the floor. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a479-v12-19","title":"暗電流的溫度依存與冷卻設計：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Temperature dependence of dark current and cooling design: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「低溫恆溫器與暗電流」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Cryostat and dark current” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在至少四個溫度、各三種曝光時間取暗場，逐像素擬合斜率得暗電流，畫 ln(D) 對 1/T 的 Arrhenius 圖求活化能，判斷是產生、擴散或表面機制主導；以快門關閉與鏡頭完全遮蓋兩種方式比較，排除漏光；建立熱像素地圖並記錄角落是否有放大器輝光。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Take darks at four or more temperatures with three exposure times each, fit the per-pixel slope to obtain dark current, and plot ln(D) against 1/T in an Arrhenius plot to find the activation energy and decide whether generation, diffusion or surface mechanisms dominate; compare shutter-closed with fully capped darks to rule out light leaks; build a hot-pixel map and note any amplifier glow at the corners. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：恆溫器真空劣化或窗片結霜時晶片降不到設定溫度，暗電流每 6 K 翻倍而無人察覺；暗場與科學影像在不同溫度拍攝，扣除後殘留熱像素圖樣，長曝光的暗弱源被雜點淹沒或出現假源。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If cryostat vacuum degrades or the window frosts, the chip cannot reach its set point and dark current doubles every 6 K unnoticed; darks taken at a different temperature from science frames leave a residual hot-pixel pattern after subtraction, burying faint sources in long exposures or creating false ones.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在至少四個溫度、各三種曝光時間取暗場，逐像素擬合斜率得暗電流，畫 ln(D) 對 1/T 的 Arrhenius 圖求活化能，判斷是產生、擴散或表面機制主導；以快門關閉與鏡頭完全遮蓋兩種方式比較，排除漏光；建立熱像素地圖並記錄角落是否有放大器輝光。","textEn":"Take darks at four or more temperatures with three exposure times each, fit the per-pixel slope to obtain dark current, and plot ln(D) against 1/T in an Arrhenius plot to find the activation energy and decide whether generation, diffusion or surface mechanisms dominate; compare shutter-closed with fully capped darks to rule out light leaks; build a hot-pixel map and note any amplifier glow at the corners.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「暗電流的溫度依存與冷卻設計」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Temperature dependence of dark current and cooling design\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","在至少四個溫度、各三種曝光時間取暗場，逐像素擬合斜率得暗電流，畫 ln(D) 對 1/T 的 Arrhenius 圖求活化能，判斷是產生、擴散或表面機制主導。","讀出雜訊只與晶片有關，與讀出速度無關。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Take darks at four or more temperatures with three exposure times each, fit the per-pixel slope to obtain dark current, and plot ln(D) against 1/T in an Arrhenius plot to find the activation energy and decide whether generation, diffusion or surface mechanisms dominate.","Read noise belongs to the chip alone and does not depend on readout speed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在至少四個溫度、各三種曝光時間取暗場，逐像素擬合斜率得暗電流，畫 ln(D) 對 1/T 的 Arrhenius 圖求活化能，判斷是產生、擴散或表面機制主導；以快門關閉與鏡頭完全遮蓋兩種方式比較，排除漏光；建立熱像素地圖並記錄角落是否有放大器輝光。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Take darks at four or more temperatures with three exposure times each, fit the per-pixel slope to obtain dark current, and plot ln(D) against 1/T in an Arrhenius plot to find the activation energy and decide whether generation, diffusion or surface mechanisms dominate; compare shutter-closed with fully capped darks to rule out light leaks; build a hot-pixel map and note any amplifier glow at the corners. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a479-v12-20","title":"暗電流的溫度依存與冷卻設計：失效診斷","titleEn":"Temperature dependence of dark current and cooling design: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「低溫恆溫器與暗電流」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Cryostat and dark current” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"恆溫器真空劣化或窗片結霜時晶片降不到設定溫度，暗電流每 6 K 翻倍而無人察覺；暗場與科學影像在不同溫度拍攝，扣除後殘留熱像素圖樣，長曝光的暗弱源被雜點淹沒或出現假源。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If cryostat vacuum degrades or the window frosts, the chip cannot reach its set point and dark current doubles every 6 K unnoticed; darks taken at a different temperature from science frames leave a residual hot-pixel pattern after subtraction, burying faint sources in long exposures or creating false ones. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：實驗室相機以多級熱電致冷到 −70 到 −100 °C，天文台常用液氮或閉循環冷頭到 −100 °C 以下；但溫度太低時部分陷阱釋放時間變長而使 CTE 變差，暗電流也會被時脈感應電荷與輝光等其他來源墊底。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Laboratory cameras use multistage thermoelectric coolers to reach −70 to −100 °C, and observatories use liquid nitrogen or closed-cycle cold heads below −100 °C; too cold, however, lengthens some trap emission times and worsens CTE, and dark current is floored by other sources such as clock-induced charge and glow.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「溫度越低越好，CCD 冷到最低溫就沒有任何代價。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Colder is always better; cooling a CCD to its minimum has no penalty.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"恆溫器真空劣化或窗片結霜時晶片降不到設定溫度，暗電流每 6 K 翻倍而無人察覺；暗場與科學影像在不同溫度拍攝，扣除後殘留熱像素圖樣，長曝光的暗弱源被雜點淹沒或出現假源。","textEn":"If cryostat vacuum degrades or the window frosts, the chip cannot reach its set point and dark current doubles every 6 K unnoticed; darks taken at a different temperature from science frames leave a residual hot-pixel pattern after subtraction, burying faint sources in long exposures or creating false ones.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「暗電流的溫度依存與冷卻設計」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Temperature dependence of dark current and cooling design\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","增益就是 ADC 位元數除以滿井，不需量測。","恆溫器真空劣化或窗片結霜時晶片降不到設定溫度，暗電流每 6 K 翻倍而無人察覺。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Gain is simply full well divided by ADC range and needs no measurement.","If cryostat vacuum degrades or the window frosts, the chip cannot reach its set point and dark current doubles every 6 K unnoticed."],"answer":2,"explanation":"恆溫器真空劣化或窗片結霜時晶片降不到設定溫度，暗電流每 6 K 翻倍而無人察覺；暗場與科學影像在不同溫度拍攝，扣除後殘留熱像素圖樣，長曝光的暗弱源被雜點淹沒或出現假源。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If cryostat vacuum degrades or the window frosts, the chip cannot reach its set point and dark current doubles every 6 K unnoticed; darks taken at a different temperature from science frames leave a residual hot-pixel pattern after subtraction, burying faint sources in long exposures or creating false ones. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a479-v12-21","title":"光子轉移曲線與 Fe-55 增益校正：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Photon transfer curve and Fe-55 gain calibration: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「平場對與 Fe-55 X 光源」如何決定科學級 CCD 成像系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Flat-field pairs and Fe-55 source” determines the key performance of “Scientific CCD imaging systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"相機增益 K（e⁻/DN）可由光子散粒雜訊的統計求得：訊號 S 個電子的變異數等於 S，兩張同條件平場相減可消去像素響應不均，差值變異數的一半等於 S/K 加上讀出雜訊平方。Fe-55 放射源的 Mn Kα 5.9 keV X 光在單一像素產生約 1616 個電子，提供獨立的絕對增益。厚 CCD 在高訊號時，已收集的電荷會把後來的電荷推向鄰近像素，造成相鄰像素正相關、單像素變異數低於泊松值的亮者變胖效應，必須把共變異數加回去。PTC 的轉折點同時給出滿井容量，要與 ADC 的量化範圍匹配。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「平場對與 Fe-55 X 光源」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Camera gain K in e⁻/DN follows from photon shot-noise statistics: a signal of S electrons has variance S, and subtracting two flats taken under identical conditions cancels pixel response non-uniformity, so half the variance of the difference equals S/K plus the read noise squared. The 5.9 keV Mn Kα X-rays from an Fe-55 source create about 1616 electrons in a single pixel, giving an independent absolute gain. In thick CCDs at high signal, collected charge pushes later charge into neighbouring pixels, the brighter-fatter effect, which correlates neighbours and lowers single-pixel variance below Poisson, so covariances must be added back. The PTC turnover also marks full well, which must be matched to the ADC range. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Flat-field pairs and Fe-55 source”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：設 K = 1.5 e⁻/DN：平均 10 000 DN = 15 000 e⁻，散粒變異數 15 000/1.5² = 6667 DN²，讀出雜訊 2.9 e⁻ = 1.93 DN 即 3.74 DN²，量得 6670.4 DN²，K = 10 000/(6670.4 − 3.74) = 1.50。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Assume K = 1.5 e⁻/DN: a mean of 10 000 DN is 15 000 e⁻, shot variance 15 000/1.5² = 6667 DN², and 2.9 e⁻ read noise is 1.93 DN or 3.74 DN²; measuring 6670.4 DN² gives K = 10 000/(6670.4 − 3.74) = 1.50.","failure":"常見誤解：「增益就是 ADC 位元數除以滿井，不需量測。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Gain is simply full well divided by ADC range and needs no measurement.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「平場對與 Fe-55 X 光源」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Flat-field pairs and Fe-55 source”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-21-k1","title":"光子轉移曲線與 Fe-55 增益校正","titleEn":"Photon transfer curve and Fe-55 gain calibration","text":"相機增益 K（e⁻/DN）可由光子散粒雜訊的統計求得：訊號 S 個電子的變異數等於 S，兩張同條件平場相減可消去像素響應不均，差值變異數的一半等於 S/K 加上讀出雜訊平方。Fe-55 放射源的 Mn Kα 5.9 keV X 光在單一像素產生約 1616 個電子，提供獨立的絕對增益。","textEn":"Camera gain K in e⁻/DN follows from photon shot-noise statistics: a signal of S electrons has variance S, and subtracting two flats taken under identical conditions cancels pixel response non-uniformity, so half the variance of the difference equals S/K plus the read noise squared. The 5.9 keV Mn Kα X-rays from an Fe-55 source create about 1616 electrons in a single pixel, giving an independent absolute gain.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：增益就是 ADC 位元數除以滿井，不需量測。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Gain is simply full well divided by ADC range and needs no measurement. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「光子轉移曲線與 Fe-55 增益校正」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Photon transfer curve and Fe-55 gain calibration\" is correct?","options":["相機增益 K（e⁻/DN）可由光子散粒雜訊的統計求得：訊號 S 個電子的變異數等於 S，兩張同條件平場相減可消去像素響應不均，差值變異數的一半等於 S/K 加上讀出雜訊平方。","增益就是 ADC 位元數除以滿井，不需量測。","像素合併只是軟體後處理，任何感測器效果都一樣。"],"optionsEn":["Camera gain K in e⁻/DN follows from photon shot-noise statistics: a signal of S electrons has variance S, and subtracting two flats taken under identical conditions cancels pixel response non-uniformity, so half the variance of the difference equals S/K plus the read noise squared.","Gain is simply full well divided by ADC range and needs no measurement.","Binning is only software post-processing and works the same on any sensor."],"answer":0,"explanation":"相機增益 K（e⁻/DN）可由光子散粒雜訊的統計求得：訊號 S 個電子的變異數等於 S，兩張同條件平場相減可消去像素響應不均，差值變異數的一半等於 S/K 加上讀出雜訊平方。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Camera gain K in e⁻/DN follows from photon shot-noise statistics: a signal of S electrons has variance S, and subtracting two flats taken under identical conditions cancels pixel response non-uniformity, so half the variance of the difference equals S/K plus the read noise squared. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a479-v12-22","title":"光子轉移曲線與 Fe-55 增益校正：定量估算","titleEn":"Photon transfer curve and Fe-55 gain calibration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「平場對與 Fe-55 X 光源」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Flat-field pairs and Fe-55 source” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：設 K = 1.5 e⁻/DN：平均 10 000 DN = 15 000 e⁻，散粒變異數 15 000/1.5² = 6667 DN²，讀出雜訊 2.9 e⁻ = 1.93 DN 即 3.74 DN²，量得 6670.4 DN²，K = 10 000/(6670.4 − 3.74) = 1.50。Fe-55：1616 e⁻ 峰值落在 1077 DN，K = 1.50 吻合。16 位元 ADC 上限 65 535 DN × 1.5 = 98 300 e⁻，略低於 100 000 e⁻ 的滿井，ADC 先飽和。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Assume K = 1.5 e⁻/DN: a mean of 10 000 DN is 15 000 e⁻, shot variance 15 000/1.5² = 6667 DN², and 2.9 e⁻ read noise is 1.93 DN or 3.74 DN²; measuring 6670.4 DN² gives K = 10 000/(6670.4 − 3.74) = 1.50. Fe-55: a 1616 e⁻ peak at 1077 DN gives K = 1.50, in agreement. A 16-bit ADC tops out at 65 535 DN × 1.5 = 98 300 e⁻, slightly below the 100 000 e⁻ full well, so the ADC saturates first. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：從 100 DN 到飽和取 20 組以上的平場對，畫雜訊對訊號的對數 PTC，確認讀出雜訊平台、斜率 1/2 的散粒段與滿井轉折；計算最近鄰像素共變異數隨訊號的增長並加回變異數；另以 Fe-55 曝光挑出單像素事件做直方圖，比較兩種 K 值，差異應小於 1%。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Take more than 20 flat pairs from 100 DN to saturation and plot a log–log PTC of noise versus signal, confirming the read-noise floor, the slope-1/2 shot-noise segment and the full-well turnover; compute how nearest-neighbour covariance grows with signal and add it back to the variance; histogram single-pixel events from an Fe-55 exposure and require the two K values to agree within 1%.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"設 K = 1.5 e⁻/DN：平均 10 000 DN = 15 000 e⁻，散粒變異數 15 000/1.5² = 6667 DN²，讀出雜訊 2.9 e⁻ = 1.93 DN 即 3.74 DN²，量得 6670.4 DN²，K = 10 000/(6670.4 − 3.74) = 1.50。Fe-55：1616 e⁻ 峰值落在 1077 DN，K = 1.50 吻合。16 位元 ADC 上限 65 535 DN × 1.5 = 98 300 e⁻，略低於 100 000 e⁻ 的滿井，ADC 先飽和。","textEn":"Assume K = 1.5 e⁻/DN: a mean of 10 000 DN is 15 000 e⁻, shot variance 15 000/1.5² = 6667 DN², and 2.9 e⁻ read noise is 1.93 DN or 3.74 DN²; measuring 6670.4 DN² gives K = 10 000/(6670.4 − 3.74) = 1.50. Fe-55: a 1616 e⁻ peak at 1077 DN gives K = 1.50, in agreement. A 16-bit ADC tops out at 65 535 DN × 1.5 = 98 300 e⁻, slightly below the 100 000 e⁻ full well, so the ADC saturates first.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「光子轉移曲線與 Fe-55 增益校正」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Photon transfer curve and Fe-55 gain calibration\", which statement holds?","options":["背照式 CCD 在所有波長都有九成以上的量子效率。","設 K = 1.5 e⁻/DN：平均 10 000 DN = 15 000 e⁻，散粒變異數 15 000/1.5² = 6667 DN²，讀出雜訊 2.9 e⁻ = 1.93 DN 即 3.74 DN²，量得 6670.4 DN²，K = 10 000/(6670.4 − 3.74) = 1.50。","讀出雜訊只與晶片有關，與讀出速度無關。"],"optionsEn":["A back-illuminated CCD has over 90% QE at every wavelength.","Assume K = 1.5 e⁻/DN: a mean of 10 000 DN is 15 000 e⁻, shot variance 15 000/1.5² = 6667 DN², and 2.9 e⁻ read noise is 1.93 DN or 3.74 DN².","Read noise belongs to the chip alone and does not depend on readout speed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"設 K = 1.5 e⁻/DN：平均 10 000 DN = 15 000 e⁻，散粒變異數 15 000/1.5² = 6667 DN²，讀出雜訊 2.9 e⁻ = 1.93 DN 即 3.74 DN²，量得 6670.4 DN²，K = 10 000/(6670.4 − 3.74) = 1.50。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Assume K = 1.5 e⁻/DN: a mean of 10 000 DN is 15 000 e⁻, shot variance 15 000/1.5² = 6667 DN², and 2.9 e⁻ read noise is 1.93 DN or 3.74 DN²; measuring 6670.4 DN² gives K = 10 000/(6670.4 − 3.74) = 1.50. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a479-v12-23","title":"光子轉移曲線與 Fe-55 增益校正：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Photon transfer curve and Fe-55 gain calibration: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「平場對與 Fe-55 X 光源」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Flat-field pairs and Fe-55 source” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"從 100 DN 到飽和取 20 組以上的平場對，畫雜訊對訊號的對數 PTC，確認讀出雜訊平台、斜率 1/2 的散粒段與滿井轉折；計算最近鄰像素共變異數隨訊號的增長並加回變異數；另以 Fe-55 曝光挑出單像素事件做直方圖，比較兩種 K 值，差異應小於 1%。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Take more than 20 flat pairs from 100 DN to saturation and plot a log–log PTC of noise versus signal, confirming the read-noise floor, the slope-1/2 shot-noise segment and the full-well turnover; compute how nearest-neighbour covariance grows with signal and add it back to the variance; histogram single-pixel events from an Fe-55 exposure and require the two K values to agree within 1%. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：用單張平場而非平場對計算變異數，1% 的像素響應不均在 15 000 e⁻ 時貢獻 (0.01×15 000)² = 22 500 e⁻²，大於散粒變異數，估出的 K 只有 0.6 e⁻/DN，低估六成；忽略亮者變胖效應則高訊號段的 K 被高估，所有以電子數表示的雜訊與滿井數字都跟著錯。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Computing variance from single flats instead of pairs lets 1% response non-uniformity contribute (0.01×15 000)² = 22 500 e⁻² at 15 000 e⁻, more than the shot variance, so K comes out at 0.6 e⁻/DN, 60% low; ignoring the brighter-fatter effect overestimates K at high signal, and every noise and full-well number quoted in electrons is wrong with it.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"從 100 DN 到飽和取 20 組以上的平場對，畫雜訊對訊號的對數 PTC，確認讀出雜訊平台、斜率 1/2 的散粒段與滿井轉折；計算最近鄰像素共變異數隨訊號的增長並加回變異數；另以 Fe-55 曝光挑出單像素事件做直方圖，比較兩種 K 值，差異應小於 1%。","textEn":"Take more than 20 flat pairs from 100 DN to saturation and plot a log–log PTC of noise versus signal, confirming the read-noise floor, the slope-1/2 shot-noise segment and the full-well turnover; compute how nearest-neighbour covariance grows with signal and add it back to the variance; histogram single-pixel events from an Fe-55 exposure and require the two K values to agree within 1%.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「光子轉移曲線與 Fe-55 增益校正」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Photon transfer curve and Fe-55 gain calibration\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","矽越厚越好，因為紅光量子效率一定越高。","從 100 DN 到飽和取 20 組以上的平場對，畫雜訊對訊號的對數 PTC，確認讀出雜訊平台、斜率 1/2 的散粒段與滿井轉折。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","Thicker silicon is always better because red QE rises.","Take more than 20 flat pairs from 100 DN to saturation and plot a log–log PTC of noise versus signal, confirming the read-noise floor, the slope-1/2 shot-noise segment and the full-well turnover."],"answer":2,"explanation":"從 100 DN 到飽和取 20 組以上的平場對，畫雜訊對訊號的對數 PTC，確認讀出雜訊平台、斜率 1/2 的散粒段與滿井轉折；計算最近鄰像素共變異數隨訊號的增長並加回變異數；另以 Fe-55 曝光挑出單像素事件做直方圖，比較兩種 K 值，差異應小於 1%。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Take more than 20 flat pairs from 100 DN to saturation and plot a log–log PTC of noise versus signal, confirming the read-noise floor, the slope-1/2 shot-noise segment and the full-well turnover; compute how nearest-neighbour covariance grows with signal and add it back to the variance; histogram single-pixel events from an Fe-55 exposure and require the two K values to agree within 1%. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a479-v12-24","title":"光子轉移曲線與 Fe-55 增益校正：失效診斷","titleEn":"Photon transfer curve and Fe-55 gain calibration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「平場對與 Fe-55 X 光源」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Flat-field pairs and Fe-55 source” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"用單張平場而非平場對計算變異數，1% 的像素響應不均在 15 000 e⁻ 時貢獻 (0.01×15 000)² = 22 500 e⁻²，大於散粒變異數，估出的 K 只有 0.6 e⁻/DN，低估六成；忽略亮者變胖效應則高訊號段的 K 被高估，所有以電子數表示的雜訊與滿井數字都跟著錯。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Computing variance from single flats instead of pairs lets 1% response non-uniformity contribute (0.01×15 000)² = 22 500 e⁻² at 15 000 e⁻, more than the shot variance, so K comes out at 0.6 e⁻/DN, 60% low; ignoring the brighter-fatter effect overestimates K at high signal, and every noise and full-well number quoted in electrons is wrong with it. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：PTC 的轉折點同時給出滿井容量，要與 ADC 的量化範圍匹配。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The PTC turnover also marks full well, which must be matched to the ADC range.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「增益就是 ADC 位元數除以滿井，不需量測。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Gain is simply full well divided by ADC range and needs no measurement.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"用單張平場而非平場對計算變異數，1% 的像素響應不均在 15 000 e⁻ 時貢獻 (0.01×15 000)² = 22 500 e⁻²，大於散粒變異數，估出的 K 只有 0.6 e⁻/DN，低估六成；忽略亮者變胖效應則高訊號段的 K 被高估，所有以電子數表示的雜訊與滿井數字都跟著錯。","textEn":"Computing variance from single flats instead of pairs lets 1% response non-uniformity contribute (0.01×15 000)² = 22 500 e⁻² at 15 000 e⁻, more than the shot variance, so K comes out at 0.6 e⁻/DN, 60% low; ignoring the brighter-fatter effect overestimates K at high signal, and every noise and full-well number quoted in electrons is wrong with it.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「光子轉移曲線與 Fe-55 增益校正」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Photon transfer curve and Fe-55 gain calibration\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["用單張平場而非平場對計算變異數，1% 的像素響應不均在 15 000 e⁻ 時貢獻 (0.01×15 000)² = 22 500 e⁻²，大於散粒變異數，估出的 K 只有 0.6 e⁻/DN，低估六成。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","像素合併只是軟體後處理，任何感測器效果都一樣。"],"optionsEn":["Computing variance from single flats instead of pairs lets 1% response non-uniformity contribute (0.01×15 000)² = 22 500 e⁻² at 15 000 e⁻, more than the shot variance, so K comes out at 0.6 e⁻/DN, 60% low.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","Binning is only software post-processing and works the same on any sensor."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用單張平場而非平場對計算變異數，1% 的像素響應不均在 15 000 e⁻ 時貢獻 (0.01×15 000)² = 22 500 e⁻²，大於散粒變異數，估出的 K 只有 0.6 e⁻/DN，低估六成；忽略亮者變胖效應則高訊號段的 K 被高估，所有以電子數表示的雜訊與滿井數字都跟著錯。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Computing variance from single flats instead of pairs lets 1% response non-uniformity contribute (0.01×15 000)² = 22 500 e⁻² at 15 000 e⁻, more than the shot variance, so K comes out at 0.6 e⁻/DN, 60% low; ignoring the brighter-fatter effect overestimates K at high signal, and every noise and full-well number quoted in electrons is wrong with it. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a479-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「影像校正鏈、晶片上合併與宇宙射線」與「相機驗收、多輸出串擾與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Calibration chain, on-chip binning and cosmic rays\" and \"Camera acceptance, multi-output crosstalk and handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a479-v12-25","title":"影像校正鏈、晶片上合併與宇宙射線：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Calibration chain, on-chip binning and cosmic rays: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「偏壓、暗場、平場與宇宙射線」如何決定科學級 CCD 成像系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Bias, darks, flats and cosmic rays” determines the key performance of “Scientific CCD imaging systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"科學影像依序扣除過掃描區估得的偏壓位準與主偏壓的結構、扣除依曝光時間縮放的暗場、除以正規化的主平場，再套用壞像素遮罩並剔除宇宙射線；剔除可用多張曝光的中位數或以拉普拉斯邊緣偵測找出比點擴散函數更銳利的事件。CCD 可在晶片上合併像素：在水平暫存器或加總井中把相鄰電荷先相加再讀一次，整組只付一次讀出雜訊，這是 CCD 相對於逐像素讀出感測器的特殊優勢，但受水平暫存器滿井與解析度損失限制。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「偏壓、暗場、平場與宇宙射線」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Science frames have the bias level estimated from the overscan and the master-bias structure removed, then a dark scaled to exposure time subtracted, a normalised master flat divided out, a bad-pixel mask applied and cosmic rays rejected, either by median-combining several exposures or by Laplacian edge detection of events sharper than the point-spread function. A CCD can bin on chip, summing neighbouring charge in the serial register or a summing well before a single read, so the group pays read noise only once; this is a distinctive CCD advantage over pixel-by-pixel readout sensors, limited by serial-register full well and loss of resolution. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Bias, darks, flats and cosmic rays”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：每像素 4 e⁻、讀出雜訊 2.9 e⁻：四像素分別讀出再相加 SNR = 16/√(16 + 4×8.41) = 2.27；晶片上 2×2 合併只讀一次 SNR = 16/√(16 + 8.41) = 3.24，提升 43%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: At 4 e⁻ per pixel and 2.9 e⁻ read noise, reading four pixels separately and summing gives SNR = 16/√(16 + 4×8.41) = 2.27, while 2×2 on-chip binning read once gives 16/√(16 + 8.41) = 3.24, 43% better.","failure":"常見誤解：「像素合併只是軟體後處理，任何感測器效果都一樣。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Binning is only software post-processing and works the same on any sensor.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「偏壓、暗場、平場與宇宙射線」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Bias, darks, flats and cosmic rays”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-25-k1","title":"影像校正鏈、晶片上合併與宇宙射線","titleEn":"Calibration chain, on-chip binning and cosmic rays","text":"科學影像依序扣除過掃描區估得的偏壓位準與主偏壓的結構、扣除依曝光時間縮放的暗場、除以正規化的主平場，再套用壞像素遮罩並剔除宇宙射線；剔除可用多張曝光的中位數或以拉普拉斯邊緣偵測找出比點擴散函數更銳利的事件。CCD 可在晶片上合併像素：在水平暫存器或加總井中把相鄰電荷先相加再讀一次，整組只付一次讀出雜訊，這是 CCD 相對於逐像素讀出感測器的特殊優勢，但受水平暫存器滿井與解析度損失限制。","textEn":"Science frames have the bias level estimated from the overscan and the master-bias structure removed, then a dark scaled to exposure time subtracted, a normalised master flat divided out, a bad-pixel mask applied and cosmic rays rejected, either by median-combining several exposures or by Laplacian edge detection of events sharper than the point-spread function. A CCD can bin on chip, summing neighbouring charge in the serial register or a summing well before a single read, so the group pays read noise only once; this is a distinctive CCD advantage over pixel-by-pixel readout sensors, limited by serial-register full well and loss of resolution.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：像素合併只是軟體後處理，任何感測器效果都一樣。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Binning is only software post-processing and works the same on any sensor. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「影像校正鏈、晶片上合併與宇宙射線」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Calibration chain, on-chip binning and cosmic rays\" is correct?","options":["像素合併只是軟體後處理，任何感測器效果都一樣。","科學影像依序扣除過掃描區估得的偏壓位準與主偏壓的結構、扣除依曝光時間縮放的暗場、除以正規化的主平場，再套用壞像素遮罩並剔除宇宙射線。","出廠規格合格的 CCD，裝進相機後不必再做系統驗收。"],"optionsEn":["Binning is only software post-processing and works the same on any sensor.","Science frames have the bias level estimated from the overscan and the master-bias structure removed, then a dark scaled to exposure time subtracted, a normalised master flat divided out, a bad-pixel mask applied and cosmic rays rejected, either by median-combining several exposures or by Laplacian edge detection of events sharper than the point-spread function.","A CCD that met factory specifications needs no system acceptance once installed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"科學影像依序扣除過掃描區估得的偏壓位準與主偏壓的結構、扣除依曝光時間縮放的暗場、除以正規化的主平場，再套用壞像素遮罩並剔除宇宙射線；剔除可用多張曝光的中位數或以拉普拉斯邊緣偵測找出比點擴散函數更銳利的事件。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Science frames have the bias level estimated from the overscan and the master-bias structure removed, then a dark scaled to exposure time subtracted, a normalised master flat divided out, a bad-pixel mask applied and cosmic rays rejected, either by median-combining several exposures or by Laplacian edge detection of events sharper than the point-spread function. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a479-v12-26","title":"影像校正鏈、晶片上合併與宇宙射線：定量估算","titleEn":"Calibration chain, on-chip binning and cosmic rays: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「偏壓、暗場、平場與宇宙射線」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Bias, darks, flats and cosmic rays” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：每像素 4 e⁻、讀出雜訊 2.9 e⁻：四像素分別讀出再相加 SNR = 16/√(16 + 4×8.41) = 2.27；晶片上 2×2 合併只讀一次 SNR = 16/√(16 + 8.41) = 3.24，提升 43%。宇宙射線：海平面約 1 個/cm²/min，27.6 mm 見方晶片 7.6 cm²，1800 s 約 228 次；最小游離粒子在矽中約 80 e⁻/µm，垂直穿過 15 µm 留下 1200 e⁻，40 µm 深空乏留下 3200 e⁻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: At 4 e⁻ per pixel and 2.9 e⁻ read noise, reading four pixels separately and summing gives SNR = 16/√(16 + 4×8.41) = 2.27, while 2×2 on-chip binning read once gives 16/√(16 + 8.41) = 3.24, 43% better. Cosmic rays: about 1 per cm² per minute at sea level, so a 27.6 mm square 7.6 cm² chip sees about 228 in 1800 s; a minimum-ionising particle leaves about 80 e⁻/µm in silicon, 1200 e⁻ crossing 15 µm vertically and 3200 e⁻ in 40 µm of deep-depleted silicon. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：每張影像記錄過掃描區平均與標準差以追蹤偏壓漂移；以 50 張偏壓影像建主偏壓並以兩兩相減驗證讀出雜訊；比較合併與未合併模式下的讀出雜訊與增益；以長時間暗場統計宇宙射線事件率與電荷分布，調整剔除門檻並檢查假剔除率。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Log overscan mean and standard deviation for every frame to track bias drift; build a master bias from 50 frames and verify read noise from pairwise differences; compare read noise and gain in binned and unbinned modes; use long darks to measure cosmic-ray event rate and charge distribution, then tune the rejection threshold and check the false-rejection rate.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"每像素 4 e⁻、讀出雜訊 2.9 e⁻：四像素分別讀出再相加 SNR = 16/√(16 + 4×8.41) = 2.27；晶片上 2×2 合併只讀一次 SNR = 16/√(16 + 8.41) = 3.24，提升 43%。宇宙射線：海平面約 1 個/cm²/min，27.6 mm 見方晶片 7.6 cm²，1800 s 約 228 次；最小游離粒子在矽中約 80 e⁻/µm，垂直穿過 15 µm 留下 1200 e⁻，40 µm 深空乏留下 3200 e⁻。","textEn":"At 4 e⁻ per pixel and 2.9 e⁻ read noise, reading four pixels separately and summing gives SNR = 16/√(16 + 4×8.41) = 2.27, while 2×2 on-chip binning read once gives 16/√(16 + 8.41) = 3.24, 43% better. Cosmic rays: about 1 per cm² per minute at sea level, so a 27.6 mm square 7.6 cm² chip sees about 228 in 1800 s; a minimum-ionising particle leaves about 80 e⁻/µm in silicon, 1200 e⁻ crossing 15 µm vertically and 3200 e⁻ in 40 µm of deep-depleted silicon.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「影像校正鏈、晶片上合併與宇宙射線」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Calibration chain, on-chip binning and cosmic rays\", which statement holds?","options":["CTE 為 0.99999 已經接近完美，大面積 CCD 不必再擔心。","矽越厚越好，因為紅光量子效率一定越高。","每像素 4 e⁻、讀出雜訊 2.9 e⁻：四像素分別讀出再相加 SNR = 16/√(16 + 4×8.41) = 2.27。"],"optionsEn":["A CTE of 0.99999 is essentially perfect even for large CCDs.","Thicker silicon is always better because red QE rises.","At 4 e⁻ per pixel and 2.9 e⁻ read noise, reading four pixels separately and summing gives SNR = 16/√(16 + 4×8.41) = 2.27, while 2×2 on-chip binning read once gives 16/√(16 + 8.41) = 3.24, 43% better."],"answer":2,"explanation":"每像素 4 e⁻、讀出雜訊 2.9 e⁻：四像素分別讀出再相加 SNR = 16/√(16 + 4×8.41) = 2.27；晶片上 2×2 合併只讀一次 SNR = 16/√(16 + 8.41) = 3.24，提升 43%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"At 4 e⁻ per pixel and 2.9 e⁻ read noise, reading four pixels separately and summing gives SNR = 16/√(16 + 4×8.41) = 2.27, while 2×2 on-chip binning read once gives 16/√(16 + 8.41) = 3.24, 43% better. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a479-v12-27","title":"影像校正鏈、晶片上合併與宇宙射線：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Calibration chain, on-chip binning and cosmic rays: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「偏壓、暗場、平場與宇宙射線」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Bias, darks, flats and cosmic rays” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"每張影像記錄過掃描區平均與標準差以追蹤偏壓漂移；以 50 張偏壓影像建主偏壓並以兩兩相減驗證讀出雜訊；比較合併與未合併模式下的讀出雜訊與增益；以長時間暗場統計宇宙射線事件率與電荷分布，調整剔除門檻並檢查假剔除率。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Log overscan mean and standard deviation for every frame to track bias drift; build a master bias from 50 frames and verify read noise from pairwise differences; compare read noise and gain in binned and unbinned modes; use long darks to measure cosmic-ray event rate and charge distribution, then tune the rejection threshold and check the false-rejection rate. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：合併後的總電荷超過水平暫存器容量，亮星電荷沿水平方向溢出成條紋並污染同一列的暗弱源；在深空乏元件上只拍一張長曝光，數百條宇宙射線徑跡無法用中位數剔除，被誤認為暫現源或移動天體。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Binned charge that exceeds serial-register capacity spills bright-star charge into horizontal streaks that contaminate faint sources in the same row; taking a single long exposure on a deep-depletion device leaves hundreds of cosmic-ray tracks that cannot be median-rejected and are mistaken for transients or moving objects.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每張影像記錄過掃描區平均與標準差以追蹤偏壓漂移；以 50 張偏壓影像建主偏壓並以兩兩相減驗證讀出雜訊；比較合併與未合併模式下的讀出雜訊與增益；以長時間暗場統計宇宙射線事件率與電荷分布，調整剔除門檻並檢查假剔除率。","textEn":"Log overscan mean and standard deviation for every frame to track bias drift; build a master bias from 50 frames and verify read noise from pairwise differences; compare read noise and gain in binned and unbinned modes; use long darks to measure cosmic-ray event rate and charge distribution, then tune the rejection threshold and check the false-rejection rate.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「影像校正鏈、晶片上合併與宇宙射線」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Calibration chain, on-chip binning and cosmic rays\"?","options":["每張影像記錄過掃描區平均與標準差以追蹤偏壓漂移。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","溫度越低越好，CCD 冷到最低溫就沒有任何代價。"],"optionsEn":["Log overscan mean and standard deviation for every frame to track bias drift.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Colder is always better; cooling a CCD to its minimum has no penalty."],"answer":0,"explanation":"每張影像記錄過掃描區平均與標準差以追蹤偏壓漂移；以 50 張偏壓影像建主偏壓並以兩兩相減驗證讀出雜訊；比較合併與未合併模式下的讀出雜訊與增益；以長時間暗場統計宇宙射線事件率與電荷分布，調整剔除門檻並檢查假剔除率。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Log overscan mean and standard deviation for every frame to track bias drift; build a master bias from 50 frames and verify read noise from pairwise differences; compare read noise and gain in binned and unbinned modes; use long darks to measure cosmic-ray event rate and charge distribution, then tune the rejection threshold and check the false-rejection rate. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a479-v12-28","title":"影像校正鏈、晶片上合併與宇宙射線：失效診斷","titleEn":"Calibration chain, on-chip binning and cosmic rays: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「偏壓、暗場、平場與宇宙射線」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Bias, darks, flats and cosmic rays” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"合併後的總電荷超過水平暫存器容量，亮星電荷沿水平方向溢出成條紋並污染同一列的暗弱源；在深空乏元件上只拍一張長曝光，數百條宇宙射線徑跡無法用中位數剔除，被誤認為暫現源或移動天體。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Binned charge that exceeds serial-register capacity spills bright-star charge into horizontal streaks that contaminate faint sources in the same row; taking a single long exposure on a deep-depletion device leaves hundreds of cosmic-ray tracks that cannot be median-rejected and are mistaken for transients or moving objects. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：CCD 可在晶片上合併像素：在水平暫存器或加總井中把相鄰電荷先相加再讀一次，整組只付一次讀出雜訊，這是 CCD 相對於逐像素讀出感測器的特殊優勢，但受水平暫存器滿井與解析度損失限制。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A CCD can bin on chip, summing neighbouring charge in the serial register or a summing well before a single read, so the group pays read noise only once; this is a distinctive CCD advantage over pixel-by-pixel readout sensors, limited by serial-register full well and loss of resolution.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「像素合併只是軟體後處理，任何感測器效果都一樣。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Binning is only software post-processing and works the same on any sensor.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"合併後的總電荷超過水平暫存器容量，亮星電荷沿水平方向溢出成條紋並污染同一列的暗弱源；在深空乏元件上只拍一張長曝光，數百條宇宙射線徑跡無法用中位數剔除，被誤認為暫現源或移動天體。","textEn":"Binned charge that exceeds serial-register capacity spills bright-star charge into horizontal streaks that contaminate faint sources in the same row; taking a single long exposure on a deep-depletion device leaves hundreds of cosmic-ray tracks that cannot be median-rejected and are mistaken for transients or moving objects.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「影像校正鏈、晶片上合併與宇宙射線」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Calibration chain, on-chip binning and cosmic rays\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","合併後的總電荷超過水平暫存器容量，亮星電荷沿水平方向溢出成條紋並污染同一列的暗弱源。","出廠規格合格的 CCD，裝進相機後不必再做系統驗收。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Binned charge that exceeds serial-register capacity spills bright-star charge into horizontal streaks that contaminate faint sources in the same row.","A CCD that met factory specifications needs no system acceptance once installed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"合併後的總電荷超過水平暫存器容量，亮星電荷沿水平方向溢出成條紋並污染同一列的暗弱源；在深空乏元件上只拍一張長曝光，數百條宇宙射線徑跡無法用中位數剔除，被誤認為暫現源或移動天體。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Binned charge that exceeds serial-register capacity spills bright-star charge into horizontal streaks that contaminate faint sources in the same row; taking a single long exposure on a deep-depletion device leaves hundreds of cosmic-ray tracks that cannot be median-rejected and are mistaken for transients or moving objects. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a479-v12-29","title":"相機驗收、多輸出串擾與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Camera acceptance, multi-output crosstalk and handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「驗收測試台與交接紀錄」如何決定科學級 CCD 成像系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Acceptance test bench and handoff record” determines the key performance of “Scientific CCD imaging systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"相機驗收把前面的模型逐項變成量測：各輸出的 PTC 增益與讀出雜訊、以 Fe-55 與延伸像素邊緣響應量 CTE、暗電流地圖、QE 對波長、線性度、滿井與溢出、壞像素與陷阱、多輸出同時讀出時的串擾矩陣、快門時間地圖，以及深空乏元件在近紅外過曝後的殘留體影像。交接紀錄要列出時脈電壓與時序、操作溫度、各輸出增益、壞像素遮罩、串擾係數與快門修正，因為任何一項改變都會讓既有校正失效。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「驗收測試台與交接紀錄」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Camera acceptance turns the earlier models into measurements: PTC gain and read noise per output, CTE from Fe-55 and extended pixel edge response, a dark-current map, QE versus wavelength, linearity, full well and blooming, bad pixels and traps, the crosstalk matrix between outputs read simultaneously, a shutter-timing map and, for deep-depletion devices, residual bulk image after near-infrared overexposure. The handoff record lists clock voltages and timing, operating temperature, per-output gain, bad-pixel mask, crosstalk coefficients and shutter correction, because a change in any of them invalidates the existing calibration. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Acceptance test bench and handoff record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：快門：光圈式快門中央比邊緣多曝光 8 ms，1 s 平場的照度誤差 0.8%，10 s 時降為 0.08%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Shutter: an iris shutter exposing the centre 8 ms longer than the edge gives a 0.8% illumination error in a 1 s flat but only 0.08% at 10 s.","failure":"常見誤解：「出廠規格合格的 CCD，裝進相機後不必再做系統驗收。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A CCD that met factory specifications needs no system acceptance once installed.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「驗收測試台與交接紀錄」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Acceptance test bench and handoff record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-29-k1","title":"相機驗收、多輸出串擾與工程交接","titleEn":"Camera acceptance, multi-output crosstalk and handoff","text":"相機驗收把前面的模型逐項變成量測：各輸出的 PTC 增益與讀出雜訊、以 Fe-55 與延伸像素邊緣響應量 CTE、暗電流地圖、QE 對波長、線性度、滿井與溢出、壞像素與陷阱、多輸出同時讀出時的串擾矩陣、快門時間地圖，以及深空乏元件在近紅外過曝後的殘留體影像。交接紀錄要列出時脈電壓與時序、操作溫度、各輸出增益、壞像素遮罩、串擾係數與快門修正，因為任何一項改變都會讓既有校正失效。","textEn":"Camera acceptance turns the earlier models into measurements: PTC gain and read noise per output, CTE from Fe-55 and extended pixel edge response, a dark-current map, QE versus wavelength, linearity, full well and blooming, bad pixels and traps, the crosstalk matrix between outputs read simultaneously, a shutter-timing map and, for deep-depletion devices, residual bulk image after near-infrared overexposure. The handoff record lists clock voltages and timing, operating temperature, per-output gain, bad-pixel mask, crosstalk coefficients and shutter correction, because a change in any of them invalidates the existing calibration.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：出廠規格合格的 CCD，裝進相機後不必再做系統驗收。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A CCD that met factory specifications needs no system acceptance once installed. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「相機驗收、多輸出串擾與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Camera acceptance, multi-output crosstalk and handoff\" is correct?","options":["出廠規格合格的 CCD，裝進相機後不必再做系統驗收。","背照式 CCD 在所有波長都有九成以上的量子效率。","相機驗收把前面的模型逐項變成量測：各輸出的 PTC 增益與讀出雜訊、以 Fe-55 與延伸像素邊緣響應量 CTE、暗電流地圖、QE 對波長、線性度、滿井與溢出、壞像素與陷阱、多輸出同時讀出時的串擾矩陣、快門時間地圖，以及深空乏元件在近紅外過曝後的殘留體影像。"],"optionsEn":["A CCD that met factory specifications needs no system acceptance once installed.","A back-illuminated CCD has over 90% QE at every wavelength.","Camera acceptance turns the earlier models into measurements: PTC gain and read noise per output, CTE from Fe-55 and extended pixel edge response, a dark-current map, QE versus wavelength, linearity, full well and blooming, bad pixels and traps, the crosstalk matrix between outputs read simultaneously, a shutter-timing map and, for deep-depletion devices, residual bulk image after near-infrared overexposure."],"answer":2,"explanation":"相機驗收把前面的模型逐項變成量測：各輸出的 PTC 增益與讀出雜訊、以 Fe-55 與延伸像素邊緣響應量 CTE、暗電流地圖、QE 對波長、線性度、滿井與溢出、壞像素與陷阱、多輸出同時讀出時的串擾矩陣、快門時間地圖，以及深空乏元件在近紅外過曝後的殘留體影像。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Camera acceptance turns the earlier models into measurements: PTC gain and read noise per output, CTE from Fe-55 and extended pixel edge response, a dark-current map, QE versus wavelength, linearity, full well and blooming, bad pixels and traps, the crosstalk matrix between outputs read simultaneously, a shutter-timing map and, for deep-depletion devices, residual bulk image after near-infrared overexposure. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a479-v12-30","title":"相機驗收、多輸出串擾與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Camera acceptance, multi-output crosstalk and handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「驗收測試台與交接紀錄」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Acceptance test bench and handoff record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：快門：光圈式快門中央比邊緣多曝光 8 ms，1 s 平場的照度誤差 0.8%，10 s 時降為 0.08%。串擾：係數 2×10⁻⁴ 時，一顆在 A 輸出達 60 000 DN 的亮星在 B 輸出產生 12 DN 的鬼影，若天光雜訊 10 DN，鬼影超過 1σ 會被誤判為暗弱源。線性度：在 1% 到 90% 滿井範圍內殘差需小於 1%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Shutter: an iris shutter exposing the centre 8 ms longer than the edge gives a 0.8% illumination error in a 1 s flat but only 0.08% at 10 s. Crosstalk: with a coefficient of 2×10⁻⁴, a bright star reaching 60 000 DN on output A creates a 12 DN ghost on output B, above 1σ of a 10 DN sky noise and liable to be catalogued as a faint source. Linearity residuals must stay below 1% from 1% to 90% of full well. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：依固定順序執行：偏壓與讀出雜訊；PTC 與 Fe-55 增益；CTE；溫度掃描暗電流；QE；線性度與滿井；以單一輸出放置亮點光源量串擾矩陣；以多種短曝光平場相除求快門時間地圖；近紅外過曝後連續暗場量殘影。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Execute in a fixed order: bias and read noise; PTC and Fe-55 gain; CTE; dark current over a temperature scan; QE; linearity and full well; crosstalk matrix from a bright spot placed on one output at a time; shutter-timing map from ratios of short-exposure flats; residual image from consecutive darks after near-infrared overexposure.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"快門：光圈式快門中央比邊緣多曝光 8 ms，1 s 平場的照度誤差 0.8%，10 s 時降為 0.08%。串擾：係數 2×10⁻⁴ 時，一顆在 A 輸出達 60 000 DN 的亮星在 B 輸出產生 12 DN 的鬼影，若天光雜訊 10 DN，鬼影超過 1σ 會被誤判為暗弱源。線性度：在 1% 到 90% 滿井範圍內殘差需小於 1%。","textEn":"Shutter: an iris shutter exposing the centre 8 ms longer than the edge gives a 0.8% illumination error in a 1 s flat but only 0.08% at 10 s. Crosstalk: with a coefficient of 2×10⁻⁴, a bright star reaching 60 000 DN on output A creates a 12 DN ghost on output B, above 1σ of a 10 DN sky noise and liable to be catalogued as a faint source. Linearity residuals must stay below 1% from 1% to 90% of full well.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「相機驗收、多輸出串擾與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Camera acceptance, multi-output crosstalk and handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["快門：光圈式快門中央比邊緣多曝光 8 ms，1 s 平場的照度誤差 0.8%，10 s 時降為 0.08%。","讀出雜訊只與晶片有關，與讀出速度無關。","溫度越低越好，CCD 冷到最低溫就沒有任何代價。"],"optionsEn":["Shutter: an iris shutter exposing the centre 8 ms longer than the edge gives a 0.8% illumination error in a 1 s flat but only 0.08% at 10 s.","Read noise belongs to the chip alone and does not depend on readout speed.","Colder is always better; cooling a CCD to its minimum has no penalty."],"answer":0,"explanation":"快門：光圈式快門中央比邊緣多曝光 8 ms，1 s 平場的照度誤差 0.8%，10 s 時降為 0.08%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Shutter: an iris shutter exposing the centre 8 ms longer than the edge gives a 0.8% illumination error in a 1 s flat but only 0.08% at 10 s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a479-v12-31","title":"相機驗收、多輸出串擾與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Camera acceptance, multi-output crosstalk and handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「驗收測試台與交接紀錄」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Acceptance test bench and handoff record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"依固定順序執行：偏壓與讀出雜訊；PTC 與 Fe-55 增益；CTE；溫度掃描暗電流；QE；線性度與滿井；以單一輸出放置亮點光源量串擾矩陣；以多種短曝光平場相除求快門時間地圖；近紅外過曝後連續暗場量殘影。全部結果與模型並列，超出允收值者記錄原因並重新調整時脈或溫度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Execute in a fixed order: bias and read noise; PTC and Fe-55 gain; CTE; dark current over a temperature scan; QE; linearity and full well; crosstalk matrix from a bright spot placed on one output at a time; shutter-timing map from ratios of short-exposure flats; residual image from consecutive darks after near-infrared overexposure. List every result beside its model value and, when an item exceeds its allowance, record the cause and retune clocks or temperature. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：更換控制器韌體改變了時脈重疊時間，CTE 與增益同時漂移，但交接紀錄沒有時脈設定可比對，只能從頭重做全部校正；未建立串擾矩陣的巡天相機在每顆亮星的對稱位置產生鬼影，進入星表後需要大量人工清除。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A controller firmware update changes clock overlap timing so CTE and gain both drift, and without clock settings in the handoff record there is nothing to compare against except a full recalibration; a survey camera without a crosstalk matrix produces ghosts at the mirrored position of every bright star, which enter the catalogue and need extensive manual cleaning.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"依固定順序執行：偏壓與讀出雜訊；PTC 與 Fe-55 增益；CTE；溫度掃描暗電流；QE；線性度與滿井；以單一輸出放置亮點光源量串擾矩陣；以多種短曝光平場相除求快門時間地圖；近紅外過曝後連續暗場量殘影。全部結果與模型並列，超出允收值者記錄原因並重新調整時脈或溫度。","textEn":"Execute in a fixed order: bias and read noise; PTC and Fe-55 gain; CTE; dark current over a temperature scan; QE; linearity and full well; crosstalk matrix from a bright spot placed on one output at a time; shutter-timing map from ratios of short-exposure flats; residual image from consecutive darks after near-infrared overexposure. List every result beside its model value and, when an item exceeds its allowance, record the cause and retune clocks or temperature.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「相機驗收、多輸出串擾與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Camera acceptance, multi-output crosstalk and handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","依固定順序執行：偏壓與讀出雜訊。","增益就是 ADC 位元數除以滿井，不需量測。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Execute in a fixed order: bias and read noise.","Gain is simply full well divided by ADC range and needs no measurement."],"answer":1,"explanation":"依固定順序執行：偏壓與讀出雜訊；PTC 與 Fe-55 增益；CTE；溫度掃描暗電流；QE；線性度與滿井；以單一輸出放置亮點光源量串擾矩陣；以多種短曝光平場相除求快門時間地圖；近紅外過曝後連續暗場量殘影。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Execute in a fixed order: bias and read noise; PTC and Fe-55 gain; CTE; dark current over a temperature scan; QE; linearity and full well; crosstalk matrix from a bright spot placed on one output at a time; shutter-timing map from ratios of short-exposure flats; residual image from consecutive darks after near-infrared overexposure. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a479-v12-32","title":"相機驗收、多輸出串擾與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Camera acceptance, multi-output crosstalk and handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"prerequisiteIds":["a479-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「驗收測試台與交接紀錄」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Acceptance test bench and handoff record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"更換控制器韌體改變了時脈重疊時間，CTE 與增益同時漂移，但交接紀錄沒有時脈設定可比對，只能從頭重做全部校正；未建立串擾矩陣的巡天相機在每顆亮星的對稱位置產生鬼影，進入星表後需要大量人工清除。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A controller firmware update changes clock overlap timing so CTE and gain both drift, and without clock settings in the handoff record there is nothing to compare against except a full recalibration; a survey camera without a crosstalk matrix produces ghosts at the mirrored position of every bright star, which enter the catalogue and need extensive manual cleaning. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接紀錄要列出時脈電壓與時序、操作溫度、各輸出增益、壞像素遮罩、串擾係數與快門修正，因為任何一項改變都會讓既有校正失效。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff record lists clock voltages and timing, operating temperature, per-output gain, bad-pixel mask, crosstalk coefficients and shutter correction, because a change in any of them invalidates the existing calibration.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「出廠規格合格的 CCD，裝進相機後不必再做系統驗收。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A CCD that met factory specifications needs no system acceptance once installed.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a479-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"更換控制器韌體改變了時脈重疊時間，CTE 與增益同時漂移，但交接紀錄沒有時脈設定可比對，只能從頭重做全部校正；未建立串擾矩陣的巡天相機在每顆亮星的對稱位置產生鬼影，進入星表後需要大量人工清除。","textEn":"A controller firmware update changes clock overlap timing so CTE and gain both drift, and without clock settings in the handoff record there is nothing to compare against except a full recalibration; a survey camera without a crosstalk matrix produces ghosts at the mirrored position of every bright star, which enter the catalogue and need extensive manual cleaning.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]},{"id":"a479-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「相機驗收、多輸出串擾與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Camera acceptance, multi-output crosstalk and handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","背照式 CCD 在所有波長都有九成以上的量子效率。","更換控制器韌體改變了時脈重疊時間，CTE 與增益同時漂移，但交接紀錄沒有時脈設定可比對，只能從頭重做全部校正。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A back-illuminated CCD has over 90% QE at every wavelength.","A controller firmware update changes clock overlap timing so CTE and gain both drift, and without clock settings in the handoff record there is nothing to compare against except a full recalibration."],"answer":2,"explanation":"更換控制器韌體改變了時脈重疊時間，CTE 與增益同時漂移，但交接紀錄沒有時脈設定可比對，只能從頭重做全部校正；未建立串擾矩陣的巡天相機在每顆亮星的對稱位置產生鬼影，進入星表後需要大量人工清除。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A controller firmware update changes clock overlap timing so CTE and gain both drift, and without clock settings in the handoff record there is nothing to compare against except a full recalibration; a survey camera without a crosstalk matrix produces ghosts at the mirrored position of every bright star, which enter the catalogue and need extensive manual cleaning. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-andor-ikon-l-936-specifications","v12o-bnl-lsst-ccd","v12o-spie-ccd-photon-transfer"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
